    "description": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Premium A-Grade Build:</b> Identical 1:1 design with a high-quality finish, weight, and feel that matches the original aesthetic.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Active Noise Cancellation (ANC):</b> Functional ANC technology to reduce background noise, perfect for commuting or focusing in noisy environments.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Transparency Mode:</b> Hear the world around you clearly without removing your earbuds.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Modern Type-C Charging:</b> Updated with a USB-C port for universal charging convenience with modern smartphone cables.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Superior Sound Quality:</b> Enhanced drivers delivering deep bass, balanced mids, and crisp highs for an immersive listening experience.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Smart Touch Controls:</b> Manage calls, skip tracks, and adjust volume directly from the earbud stems.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Long Battery Life:</b> Enjoy up to 4–5 hours of continuous playback with multiple additional charges from the MagSafe compatible case.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,7,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Instant Pairing:</b> Seamless pop-up window connectivity for iOS devices and standard Bluetooth pairing for Android.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li></li>\n\n</ul>",
