    "description": "<strong>Features</strong>\n\n3 color lighting modes: Warm Light, Cool White, and Day Light, and each mode has Different brightness levels.\n\nZF ring light will meet all your needs in different circumstances. It is the perfect dimmable lighting to take away all the unflattering shadows. Dimming range: 1%-100%\n\nNo-Twisting-To-Lock that collapses over time, ZF’s new tripod adopts quick-flip locks and a weighted tripod base for increased stability so it won’t tip over. Made of high-quality aluminum, it can be adjusted to any length to match your needs and last you for years!\n\nYou can easily adjust the phone holder to find one angle you desire (horizontal, vertical, high-angle, low-angle, and more).\n\nThe phone holder is spring-loaded and extends up to 3.6″ wide, it is compatible with almost ALL smartphones with or without a case.\n\nWorks with most devices that support USB port, like a laptop, PC, power bank, USB charger, AC adapter, and etc.\n\nThere are four buttons on cords to power on/off, switch the lighting mode, and adjust brightness levels, it is easy to find your preferred options in seconds.\n\n\n\n<strong>Specifications:</strong>\n\n<p data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2g0o.detail.1000023.i1.525061f0NIvNpg\">Shape: Ring\n\nLED Bulbs:336 pcs（168pcs is for cold light,168pcs is for warm <a href=\"https://www.dealhub.lk/product/led-ring-fill-light-3-in-1/\">light</a>）\n\nOuter Diameter:26cm\n\nInner Diameter: 24 cm\n\nColor Temperature: 3200K-5600K\n\nDimmable: YES\n\nWatts：48W\n\nCharging: USB plug\n\nType: Ring light with stand/ring lamp for makeup\n\nAdjustable tripod stand: 70-200 cm\n\nLight size: 26cm /10 in Diameter\n\nLight color: white light, warm light, soft light\n\nAdjustment level: 10 levels\n\nDimming range: 1%-100%\n\nMaterial: Aluminum+PC\n\nColor temperature: 3200K-5500K\n\nLight Source: High quality LED <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Surface-mount_technology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SMD</a></p>\n\n<strong>Package Contents:</strong>\n\n\n\n1 x Ring Light with stand\n\n1 x  Phone holder\n\n1 x  200cm photo tripod\n\n\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-28387\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/fb885ecd8136add30d263f221cf8799f-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />",
