    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Dual-use electric mosquito racket and standing fly insect swatter</li>\n\n \t<li>Effective and efficient way to eliminate flying insects</li>\n\n \t<li>Easy to use and rechargeable</li>\n\n \t<li>Safe and eco-friendly alternative to chemical insecticides</li>\n\n \t<li>Lightweight and portable design for indoor and outdoor use</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<strong>1 Month Warranty</strong>",
    "description": "<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">POWERFUL MOSQUITO ERADICATION: This electric fly swatter delivers a voltage output of up to 3000V, effectively eliminating mosquitoes, flies, and other flying insects upon contact with the grid. Its anti-mosquito capabilities surpass those of mosquito coils, ensuring a stronger and more efficient performance.</span></li>\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">SAFETY FEATURES: The electric fly swatter is equipped with top and bottom safety nets that shield it from damage and prevent electric shock during operation. An encrypted mesh surface in the middle ensures that mosquitoes cannot escape with their wings. Additionally, residual current in the network is eliminated within 2 seconds after the power is turned off, enhancing overall safety.</span></li>\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">USB CHARGING AND EXPANSIVE MESH SURFACE: This mosquito swatter is designed with a built-in 1200mAh battery and a charging base, making it convenient to plug in and charge. Once fully charged, it can be used continuously for an extended period. The grid area measures 22*16 cm, with three layers of grids that are staggered and intersected. The mesh size is approximately 15 mm, smaller than the size of flies and mosquitoes (which are typically 3-10 mm), ensuring that mosquitoes have nowhere to escape after coming into contact with the grid area.</span></li>\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">INTELLIGENT MOSQUITO CONTROL: This electric mosquito swatter features a built-in Purple LED light. By switching the power to the ON2 position and placing it in the charging base, it functions as a mosquito killer lamp. The purple light attracts mosquitoes and other flying insects, and upon contact with the electric mosquito swatter, they are instantly eliminated.</span></li>\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">LIGHTWEIGHT AND PORTABLE: Crafted from environmentally friendly ABS material, our electric fly swatter is both drop-resistant and lightweight, providing a comfortable grip. It is an ideal companion for home use, travel, fishing, camping, or barbecuing.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29032\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/1691148471_mr6-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29031\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/1691148471_mr5-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29030\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/13308-002_720X720-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29029\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/715XiCRXduL._AC_SL1500-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29028\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/71sYSSfDLDL._AC_SL1500_-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29027\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/71HWI6TGOkL._AC_SL1500_-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29035\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/71gOWmWVt8L._AC_SL1500-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />",
