    "description": "<ul>\n\n \t<li data-spm-anchor-id=\"0.0.0.i51.28387463KpmKFE\">Bluetooth</li>\n\n \t<li data-spm-anchor-id=\"0.0.0.i51.28387463KpmKFE\">Speaker Size 4 inch</li>\n\n \t<li>FM</li>\n\n \t<li>MIC input</li>\n\n \t<li>Support USB/TF card</li>\n\n \t<li data-spm-anchor-id=\"0.0.0.i50.28387463KpmKFE\">Karaoke</li>\n\n \t<li data-spm-anchor-id=\"0.0.0.i49.28387463KpmKFE\">Portable Speaker</li>\n\n \t<li>Best Suitable for indoor and outdoor activities</li>\n\n \t<li data-spm-anchor-id=\"0.0.0.i55.28387463KpmKFE\">Best match for your travels</li>\n\n \t<li>Good Sound Quality</li>\n\n \t<li>Rechargable battery</li>\n\n \t<li>DC 5V Micro USB Charging (Charging Cable Provided)</li>\n\n \t<li>Recommended Charging Souces  : Laptop USB, Dekstop PC USB, TV USB etc...</li>\n\n \t<li>Wireless stereo twin spekers</li>\n\n \t<li>Can use by battery or while plug to the charger</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<div>\n\n<h3><u>Important</u></h3>\n\n<h3>* Use 5V DC Charging Source to Charge the Speaker</h3>\n\n<h3>* Laptop USB, Desktop PC USB, TV USB outlets are recommended to charge the Speaker</h3>\n\n<h3>* Speaker Charging Circuit can be damaged if provide more than 5V DC to Charge the speaker</h3>\n\n<h3><u>How to Tune the FM Radio in the Speaker</u></h3>\n\n<h4>1.) Turn On the Speaker</h4>\n\n<h4>2.) When you turn on the speaker it will on the Bluetooth mode (Press M button to change the mode)</h4>\n\n<h4>3.) Press mode button (M button) one time to switch to the FM mode</h4>\n\n<h4>4.) Now after switching to the FM mode press the play/ pause button one time to tune the FM</h4>\n\n<h4>5.) FM will automatically tune for the radio stations and wait until it finishes</h4>\n\n<h4 data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i1.3bf8ab08t2Q0bN\">6.) After automatic tune finished press forward/ backward buttons to switch to radio channels<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29045\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/KTX-1526-Speaker-400x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29046\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/WhatsApp-Image-2023-09-25-at-02.18.12-400x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29042\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/1-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></h4>\n\n</div>",
