    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Product Name: Motorcycle mobile phone holder</li>\n\n \t<li>Model: BO-ZJ110</li>\n\n \t<li>Material: ABS plastic + waterproof fabric</li>\n\n \t<li>Size: 10*16.5*2CM</li>\n\n \t<li>Scope: suitable for 5-6.3 inch mobile phone installation</li>\n\n \t<li>Product features: fixed mobile phone, navigation, and power supply for mobile phones, navigation</li>\n\n \t<li>Installation range: can be used on battery vehicles, motorcycles, electric tricycles, off-road vehicles, ATVs, etc.</li>\n\n \t<li>Color: Black</li>\n\n</ul>",
    "description": "<img src=\"https://www.hkbwoo.com/Content/uploads/2021685192/2021030519024183964ba1aeb94d2abcf8b001345e4e6a.jpg\" alt=\"Motorcycle mobile phone holder\" width=\"751\" height=\"751\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"0\" />\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://www.hkbwoo.com/Content/uploads/2021685192/20210305190308105c23977c5f4e4693bd7d3ca1d3e7fe.jpg\" alt=\"Motorcycle mobile phone holder waterproof\" width=\"751\" height=\"751\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"0\" />\n\n\n\nAdvantages:\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n【High Sensitivity Touch Screen】TPU transparent touch screen case with velcro pads inside, Specially designed for your phone, isolate your phone from dirt, dust, dust storms, water, rain and snow.This motorcycle mobile phone holder bag is great to keep your phone stable and allow you to see the screen clearly and operate your smart phone without taking it out while riding, such as GPS operation, using Strava and maps, answering the phone\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n【Premium Waterproof】The motorcycle mobile phone holder top tube bag is made of high-class waterproof material with sealed double zippers closure, which ensures the water doesn’t flow into the bag. You can put the earphone or USB cable between the dual zippers, without opening a new port, which is more waterproof than the bike bag with earphone opening port.\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://www.hkbwoo.com/Content/uploads/2021685192/20210305190420839ba205fb7041a1a7ba378b17ac6310.jpg\" alt=\"Motorcycle phone holder bag\" width=\"751\" height=\"751\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"0\" />\n\n\n\n【Zipper tight】High quality waterproof double zipper, with high waterproof performance.\n\n\n\nOur Motorcycle mobile phone holder uses high-quality rust-proof zipper, tightly designed, and anti-dropping. Effectively protect the mobile phone when working in severe weather and motorcycles. High-quality materials to extend the service life.\n\n\n\n【Durable & Stylish】The bike phone bag is constructed of tough EVA with 3D die-casting process. The bike bag will look stiff at any time. The Outer material Carbon fiber can be highly abrasion proof and durable. Therefore, this bike handlebar bag is dynamic, stylish, durable, shake-proof, pressure-proof and non-forming. When the bike bag is dirty, only need a wet towel, keep the bag clean all the time. Your mountain bike, road bike, folding bike and electric bike deserve this bike phone mount bag.High quality bicycle mount holder is an excellent way to mount your iPhone on your Bike, Bicycles, Motorcycles, Scooters. Withstand road shock and vibrations on bumpy trails at High Speed.\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://www.hkbwoo.com/Content/uploads/2021685192/20210305190440263d214a63114390aaba5b741fba6eb7.jpg\" alt=\"_ 5 \" />\n\n\n\n【Easy Installation】: The motorcycle cell phone holder is easy to assemble, no tool needed.Compatible with motorcycle and bicycle handlebars.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n【Big Room & Compatibility】The motorcycle mobile phone holder front frame bag has enough inside room for long rides, holds a lot of stuff i.e phone, battery, glasses, gloves, earphone, mini-flashlight, energy gel, small tire pump, repair kits, keys, wallet etc. Perfect compatible with Android/iPhone cellphone Under 6 inches, such as iPhone X XS Max XR 8 7 6s 6 plus 5s/Samsung Galaxy s8 s7 note 7.\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://www.hkbwoo.com/Content/uploads/2021685192/2021030519050360a2d6799cc4410e8c82b0f5814bfc19.jpg\" alt=\"Motorcycle mobile phone mount\" width=\"751\" height=\"751\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"0\" />",
    "attributes": []
