    "description": "<p data-spm-anchor-id=\"0.0.0.i16.33ed7463LLFqpt\">The Universal Car Windshield Phone Holder features the world's best suction technology so you can mount your smartphone or GPS device to almost any nonporous flat surface -glass, plastic, metal, wood, and even drywall.\n\nThe wide-jaw clamp easily accommodates devices with screens up to 5\" and rotates to your preferred viewing angle.\n\nOnce installed, devices can easily be rotated between landscape and portrait. In fact even if you do not own a car or have no intention of using the this holder as a car mount, it would still make a good device holder.\n\nIf the suction base gets dirty and covered in dust or fluff etc, you simply pop it under the cold tap and rinse it off. All the dust and fluff washes away and the mount is sticky again.\n\nInstallation:1. Thoroughly clean the installation site with a damp cloth 2. Attach the holder3. Press the lever down4. Open the clip and place your phone or GPS inside 5. Adjust the angle to your preference, you can also tighten it to prevent movement</p>\n\n<p data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i1.49bc155cf4HsDc\">New and high qualityNote:1. Please allow 1-2CM differs due to manual measurement.2. Real color may slightly different from pictures due to computer screen's resolution,brightness,contrast etc.Hope understanding.Have a nice shopping day</p>\n\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/collect/my/p/473439ffd4b3110998121a12a39d1a7e.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" />\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/collect/my/p/8aa6579df4bb3d4e74c1ee82891d4470.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" />\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/collect/my/p/33d0c92563e64d32fbbda28dd749c2b9.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" />\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/collect/my/p/a75ca72c9c659ece2469c3c331dd2ecf.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" />\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/collect/my/p/c4cd6fef48a42aba71604d3e1403c163.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" />\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/collect/my/p/88a83e88f3d01751c9d20c0056fb19a1.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" />\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/collect/my/p/a89c171b0bd91e2c91d1057291374f21.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" />\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/collect/my/p/329f8f9f346419eded43efd4d7abed8d.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" />\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/collect/my/p/7f6491a33f2752e37d7b959d58d56d28.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" />",
