    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Sleek and compact design for easy portability.</li>\n\n \t<li>Bluetooth connectivity enables wireless streaming from various devices.</li>\n\n \t<li>Built-in rechargeable battery for extended music playback.</li>\n\n \t<li>Crisp and clear sound output with enhanced bass.</li>\n\n \t<li>Convenient control buttons for effortless operation.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<strong>6 Months Warranty</strong>",
    "description": "<div>The BRODU Portable Bluetooth Speaker BTS-1739 combines sleek design with powerful functionality to enhance your audio experience wherever you go. With its compact and lightweight build, this speaker is effortlessly portable, making it ideal for use at home, outdoors, or on the go.</div>\n\n<div></div>\n\n<div>Equipped with Bluetooth technology, it allows seamless wireless connection to your smartphone, tablet, or other Bluetooth-enabled devices, enabling you to stream your favorite music, podcasts, or audiobooks with ease.</div>\n\n<div></div>\n\n<div>Its built-in rechargeable battery ensures long-lasting performance, providing hours of uninterrupted playback time, perfect for parties, picnics, or travel adventures.</div>\n\n<div></div>\n\n<div>The BTS-1739 delivers impressive sound quality with clear highs, rich midranges, and deep bass, allowing you to enjoy your audio content with clarity and depth.</div>\n\n<div></div>\n\n<div>Additionally, the speaker features convenient control buttons for effortless operation, putting playback and volume controls right at your fingertips. Whether you’re relaxing at home or on the move, the BRODU Portable Bluetooth Speaker BTS-1739 offers a versatile audio solution for all your entertainment needs.</div>\n\nSpecification\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Brand: Brodu</li>\n\n \t<li>Model Number: BTS1739</li>\n\n \t<li>Type: Speaker</li>\n\n \t<li>8 Inch Speaker Size</li>\n\n \t<li>AUX in: 3.5 mm AUX Jack connects to any audio player. AUX out Jack</li>\n\n \t<li>Mic in: 6.5 mm microphone hole to connect the wired microphone</li>\n\n \t<li>Wireless: connect to any audio player.</li>\n\n \t<li>USB/SD Slot</li>\n\n \t<li>FM Radio</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29295\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/BRODU-PORTABLE-BLUETOOTH-SPEAKER-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29297\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/BTS-1739-Bluetooth-Karaoke-Speak-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-29299\" src=\"https://dwstore-lk.us.stackstaging.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/BTS-1739-Bluetooth-Karaoke-Speak-2-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />",
