    "image": "https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/3a75100c-b3c8-4a55-8b46-a3f233be.jpg",
    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Brand : BWOO</li>\n\n \t<li>Modle : WL-12</li>\n\n \t<li>Mini 15W Magnetic Wireless Charger</li>\n\n \t<li>Smart Chip, PD Fast Charging Certification</li>\n\n \t<li>360° Strong Magnetic Adsorption, Precise Alignment</li>\n\n \t<li>Magnetic Induction Independent Coil, Aluminum Alloy And ABS Material</li>\n\n \t<li>Strong Compatibility</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<strong>6 Months Warranty</strong>",
    "description": "<div id=\"Features\" class=\"pws_list\">\n\n<div class=\"pws_i_act\">\n\n<p class=\"s50 after\">Mini 15W Magnetic Wireless Charger</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s16 after\">\n\n\n\nFrom the iPhone 8, which can be wirelessly charged, to today's MagSafe magnetic wireless charger, wireless charging is increasingly favored by consumers. At the same time, BWOO has launched model WL-12, a magnetic wireless charger with high-quality and cost-effective, it is more efficient, stronger magnetic, compact and more affordable than MagSafe charging, WL-12 charger maintains compatibility with Qi charging, and supports 15W, 10W, 7.5 watts, 5 watts, 3 watts, 2.5 watts automatically adjust power output, and it makes wireless charging of multiple iPhone and AirPods models more easier.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"Overview\" class=\"pws_a_video after\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pws_i_img\">\n\n<div class=\"pws_i_act\">\n\n<p class=\"s50 after\">Smart Chip, PD Fast Charging</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s16 after\">\n\n\n\nWL-12 mobile phone magnetic suction wireless charger adopts advanced smart chip, passed the authoritative CE, FCC, RoHS certification, and complies with QI technical certification, with multiple safety protections: overcurrent protection, overvoltage protection, overtemperature protection, short circuit protection , power protection, undervoltage protection, overcharge protection, electromagnetic field protection, Type-C interface supports PD protocol (it is recommended to match PD protocol power adapter above 18W), and the charging efficiency is 3 times higher than that of ordinary wireless charging (This data is tested by BWOO laboratory under specific conditions), the charging power can reach up to 15 watts.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pws_i_img_list s_pws\">\n\n<div class=\"bo_img after\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20221031/16672028692178638.jpg\" alt=\"1首屏\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_img after\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20221031/16672028699790837.jpg\" alt=\"2芯片\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_img after\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20221031/16672028704401791.jpg\" alt=\"9兼容\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_container s_pws\">\n\n<div class=\"bo_left\">\n\n<div class=\"bo_act\">\n\n<p class=\"s18 after\">NdFeB Magnet</p>\n\n<p class=\"s30 after\">Strong Adsorption</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s16 after\">\n\n\n\nThe WL-12 built-in powerful magnet ring, which can be attached when it is close to it. The mobile phone and the charging area are automatically and accurately aligned. It can be easily attached to the back of the iPhone13 and iPhone12 mobile phones or the back of the mobile phone case. The rotation angle can be adjusted freely according to your own needs when using it, which is very suitable for gamers.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_right after\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20221031/16672024892076770.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ba_b_wrap \">\n\n<div class=\"bba_con s_pws\">\n\n<div class=\"ba_swiper_left\">\n\n<div class=\"ba_swiper swiper-container swiper-container-initialized swiper-container-horizontal after\">\n\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-active\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20221031/16672028822526011.jpg\" alt=\"925x735\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-next\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20221031/16672028823617681.jpg\" alt=\"925x735-2\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20221031/16672028829431845.jpg\" alt=\"925x735-3\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pws_pag after\">\n\n<div class=\"pws_btn ba_btn_l swiper-button-disabled\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\" aria-disabled=\"true\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/static/home/images/jiantoushang_left.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"swiper-pagination ba_pag swiper-pagination-bullets\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"pws_btn ba_btn_r\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next slide\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/static/home/images/jiantoushang_right.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bab_right \">\n\n<div class=\"bab_img after\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20221031/16672024924251977.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"bab_act\">\n\n<p class=\"s30 after\">Aluminum Alloy And ABS Material Shell</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s18 after\">\n\n\n\nIn terms of material and craftsmanship, the base of the WL-12 shell is made of hard aluminum alloy material, which has a very good heat dissipation function. The surface is treated with anti-oxidation and frosted technology, which is not easy to wear and discolor. The built-in pure copper independent coil has low power and induction Fast, high charging efficiency, the panel is made of environmentally friendly ABS flame retardant material, with good insulation, safer and more reliable charging.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_container s_pws bo_s_con\">\n\n<div class=\"bo_left\">\n\n<div class=\"bo_act\">\n\n<p class=\"s30 after\">Strong Compatibility</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s18 after\">\n\n\n\nWL-12 Magnetic Wireless Charger for iPhone 13 and 12 series and AirPods, iPhone 13, iPhone 13 mini, iPhone 13 Pro, iPhone 13 Pro Max, iPhone 12, iPhone 12 Pro, iPhone 12 Pro Max, iPhone 12 mini, AirPods, AirPods Pro\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_right after\"><img src=\"https://www.bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20221031/16672024896965485.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\n</div>",
