    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Advanced Noise Cancellation</strong>: Reduces ambient noise by up to 42dB with Adaptive ANC</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>High-Quality Sound</strong>: Equipped with 10mm drivers and BassUp™ technology for powerful bass and clear treble​<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"text-token-text-secondary\"> </span></span></li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Long Battery Life</strong>: Provides up to 10 hours of playback on a single charge, with an additional 30 hours from the charging case​<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"text-token-text-secondary\"> </span></span></li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Durable and Water-Resistant</strong>: IPX5 rating ensures resistance to sweat and light rain, suitable for workouts and outdoor use​</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>User-Friendly Features</strong>: Touch controls and the Soundcore app offer 22 EQ presets</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4><strong>18</strong><strong> Months Warranty</strong></h4>",
    "description": "<h2>Soundcore R50i NC Earbuds 42dB ANC</h2>\n\nExperience the perfect blend of advanced technology, superior sound quality, and exceptional value with the Soundcore R50i NC True Wireless Earbuds by Anker. These earbuds are designed to elevate your audio experience, whether you are listening to music, making calls, or engaging in intense gaming sessions.\n\n\n\n<strong>Key Features:</strong>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Adaptive Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</strong>: Equipped with advanced ANC technology, the Soundcore R50i NC reduces ambient noise by up to 42dB, ensuring an immersive listening experience even in noisy environments. The multi-mode ANC adapts to your surroundings, providing optimal noise reduction whether you’re at home, in the office, or on the go​<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"text-token-text-secondary\"> </span></span></li>\n\n \t<li><strong>High-Quality Sound</strong>: The earbuds feature 10mm drivers that deliver rich, detailed sound with powerful bass and crisp treble. Anker’s exclusive BassUp™ technology enhances low frequencies, making these earbuds ideal for bass-heavy music genres like hip-hop and electronic dance music​<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"text-token-text-secondary\"> </span></span></li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Extended Battery Life</strong>: Enjoy up to 10 hours of continuous playback on a single charge, with the charging case providing an additional 30 hours of power, totaling 40 hours of battery life. This makes the Soundcore R50i NC perfect for long trips and extended use throughout the day​</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Durable and Water-Resistant Design</strong>: With an IPX5 water resistance rating, the Soundcore R50i NC earbuds are built to withstand sweat and light rain, making them suitable for workouts and outdoor activities. The durable build ensures longevity and reliability under various conditions​<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"text-token-text-secondary\"> </span></span></li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Touch Controls and Customization</strong>: The earbuds come with intuitive touch controls that allow you to easily manage your music, calls, and volume without reaching for your device. The Soundcore app offers 22 preset EQ modes and a Gaming Mode to reduce latency, enhancing your overall listening experience</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Enhanced Call Quality</strong>: Four microphones and AI-enhanced call technology ensure clear and stable call quality, reducing background noise and enhancing your voice during calls and online meetings​<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"text-token-text-secondary\"> </span></span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Soundcore R50i NC Earbuds</li>\n\n \t<li>Charging Case</li>\n\n \t<li>Ear Tips (Small, Medium, Large)</li>\n\n \t<li>USB-C Charging Cable</li>\n\n \t<li>User Manual</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n\n<div>\n\n<div class=\"pt-0.5 juice:pt-0\">\n\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full juice:h-8 juice:w-8\">\n\n<div class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n\n<div class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n\n<div class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\">\n\n<div class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"49ab1a17-a333-46f1-a534-ca4d84dc728c\">\n\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-[3px]\">\n\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\n\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n\n<div>\n\n<div class=\"pt-0.5 juice:pt-0\">\n\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full juice:h-8 juice:w-8\">\n\n<div class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n\n<div class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n\n<div class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\">\n\n<div class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&]:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"49ab1a17-a333-46f1-a534-ca4d84dc728c\">\n\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-[3px]\">\n\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n\n<h3>FAQ</h3>\n\n<strong>Q1: How long does the battery last on the Soundcore R50i NC?</strong>\n\n\n\nA: The earbuds offer up to 10 hours of playtime on a single charge, with an additional 30 hours provided by the charging case, totaling 40 hours.\n\n\n\n<strong>Q2: Is the Soundcore R50i NC water-resistant?</strong>\n\n\n\nA: Yes, the earbuds have an IPX5 water resistance rating, making them suitable for workouts and outdoor use.\n\n\n\n<strong>Q3: Can I customize the sound settings on the Soundcore R50i NC?</strong>\n\n\n\nA: Yes, you can use the Soundcore app to choose from 22 preset EQ modes and activate Gaming Mode for reduced latency.\n\n\n\n<strong>Q4: Does the Soundcore R50i NC support noise cancellation?</strong>\n\n\n\nA: Yes, it features Adaptive ANC that reduces background noise by up to 42dB.\n\n\n\n<strong>Q5: How do I control the earbuds?</strong>\n\n\n\nA: The earbuds come with responsive touch controls that allow you to manage your music, calls, and volume easily.\n\n\n\n<strong>Q6: What is included in the package?</strong>\n\n\n\nA: The package includes Soundcore R50i NC Earbuds, a charging case, ear tips in three sizes (S, M, L), a USB-C charging cable, and a user manual.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
