    "description": "22.5w High Speed\n\nBaseus 20000mAh 22.5W PowerBank combines PD3.0 and QC4+ fast charging technology. It can charge the latest iPhone from 0% to 60% in 35 minutes, three times faster than a traditional 1A charger. Just put it in your pocket, and you can power all your devices, even the entire family.\n\nBuild in Full Metal\n\nBaseus 20000mAh 22.5W PowerBank is made of aluminum alloy with a precise color plating process. It has a fine colour surface and a shimmering metallic lustre. The stunning design not only looks great, but also helps dissipate heat during the charging process.\n\nKnow Before You Go\n\nA digital display shows the percentage of power remaining and when to recharge. Fully charge your power bank before you go and know exactly how long your device will be on power.\n\nWide compatibility\n\nCompatible with all mobile phone models and tablets.\n\nHigh-efficiency USB Type-C\n\nEquipped with a new high-standard USB C that can both input and output, the Baseus 20000mAh 22.5W PowerBank not only allows you to charge your device super fast but also compatible with most USB C devices on the market.\n\nCharge Three Devices\n\nWith the refined design, you can use it to charge three devices, making your time more fun and efficient.\n\nFully Charge The 20000mah in 6hrs\n\nWith the ultra-fast 18W PD3.0 USB C input, it can fully charge 20000mAh in less than 6 hours, saving 50% charging time compared to traditional 5V/1A Power bank.\n\nCharge 60% in 30mins\n\nCompatible with the new iPhone 12 20W PD fast charging technology, you can charge your iPhone 12 up to 60% in about 30 minutes.\n\nCertified Safety\n\nWe built the charger with high-quality aluminum alloy and lithium battery, which is durable and impact resistant. And the charger has passed the strict CE safety certification, so you can use it without worrying about safety issues.\n\nWhy Choose Baseus 20000mAh 22.5W PowerBank?\n\nWith LED intelligent display, the charger can show real-time current, voltage and remaining power.\n\nLeading SCP 22.5W fast charging technology, also compatible with iPhone12 20W PD fast charging.\n\nThe carefully sculpted all-aluminum body is not only durable but also has an excellent grip.\n\nThe Self-developed BPS II technology makes the product charge conversion efficiency higher, lowers the temperature, and increases safety.\n\nWith up to 5 ports, it is compatible with almost all Apple and USB devices.\n\n\n\n<strong>Technical Specifications</strong>\n\n\n\nName: Baseus 20000mAh 22.5W PowerBank\n\nModel No.: PPADM20S\n\nBattery: Lithium polymer battery\n\nCapacity: 20000mAh/3.7V/74Wh\n\nRated Capacity: 12000mAh(5V-3A)\n\nEnergy Conversion Rate: >75%\n\nInput:\n\niP: 5V-2A, 9V-2A\n\nMicro: 5V-2A, 9V-2A\n\n9V-2A\n\nType-C: 5V-3A, 5.5V-3A(SCP), 9V-2A\n\nOutput:\n\n(SCP),\n\nUSB1: 4.5V-5A(SCP), 5V-4.5A(SCP),\n\n5V-3A, 9V-2A, 12V-1.5A\n\n(SCP),\n\nUSB2: 4.5V-5A(SCP), 5V-4.5A(SCP),\n\n5V-3A, 9V-2A, 12V-1.5A\n\nType-C: 5V-3A, 9V-2.22A, 12V-1.5A\n\nUSB1+USB2: 5V-3A\n\nUSB1+Type-C: 5V-3A\n\nUSB2+Type-C: 5V-3A\n\nTotal Output: 5V-3A\n\nSize: 156.8*65*28.5mm\n\nWeight: About 488g\n\nShell Material: Aluminium Alloy\n\nCertification: CE, FCC, RoHS\n\n\n\n**The above data are measured by the Baseus laboratory, the actual use will be slightly different depending on the specific circumstances.",
