    "shortDesc": "<ul class=\"\">\n\n \t<li class=\"\">This VGA to HDMI converter adapter can convert general PC signal and audio signal to HDMI format for HD displays.</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\">With this converter, the computer, laptop, DVD player, gaming consoles and some other video devices which is with VGA input can connect to large HD screens or HD projectors that is with HDMI input.</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\">It can upscale analog video signal from PC input source to digital HDMI OUTPUT, UP T0 720P OR 1080P.</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\">Besides video upscaling, the scaler box also converts input audio signal from 3.5MM to digital formats, then output to HDMI combing with the video.</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i0.38c62581wgqAG7\">No need to install drivers, portable, flexible, plug and play.</li>\n\n</ul>",
    "description": "<strong>The Mini VGA  to HDMI </strong> is a high-definition video converter which converts VGA Analog signal and analog audio signalto HDMI Digital signal . VGA signals connection For Desktop,Laptop,HD TV Box that with VGA output(D-Sub, HD 15 pin) to displays with HDMI Input such as projector, monitor, HDTV up to 720p or 1080p. .\n\n\n\nPlease Note: It only works for VGA to HDMI, Can not be used as HDMI to VGA cable. And it needs to be Powered up by 5V USB power first when you used it.\n\netc.\n\n\n\nYou can easilywatch HD Video on the normal TV without HDMI Interface.\n\n\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-8574\" src=\"https://hzone.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Mini_VGA_to_HDMI_Converter_info_1.jpg\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" srcset=\"https://hzone.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Mini_VGA_to_HDMI_Converter_info_1.jpg 640w, https://hzone.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Mini_VGA_to_HDMI_Converter_info_1-600x399.jpg 600w, https://hzone.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Mini_VGA_to_HDMI_Converter_info_1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://hzone.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Mini_VGA_to_HDMI_Converter_info_1-270x180.jpg 270w\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" />\n\n\n\n● No need to install drivers, portable, flexible, plug and play;\n\n● Full hardware conversion processing, with the characteristics of high image definition, good brightness, high contrast and good image quality;\n\n● Support hdmi-compatible 1.3 Version (compatible with 1.0/1.1/1.2), and automatically detect HDCP;\n\n● If the power supply is insufficient, the USB power supply (5V) will supply power;\n\n● VGA signal Input interface, connected to Computer,Laptop,Desktop,Monitor,Projector\n\n● Audio Input interface: connect stereo amplifier or earphone.\n\n● Support high-definition video, and high-quality, clear HDTV resolution of 1080p and computer resolution of 1920×1200 can be easily obtained\n\n● HDMI-compatible Output interface( 480p/720p/1080i/1080p/60hz;), connecting ps3/xbox360/pc graphics card / HD player / blu ray DVD / set-top box / laptop, etc;\n\n● Video input interface vga(varies with the input HDMI-compatible signal):640* 480@60Hz , 800* 600@60Hz , 1024* 768@60Hz ,1280* 720@60Hz , 1280* 768@60Hz ,1280* 800@60Hz ,1280* 1024@60Hz , 1360* 768@60Hz , 1600* 1200@60Hz , 1920* 1080@60Hz\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n<strong><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-8578\" src=\"https://hzone.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Prolink_PMW5010_info_3.jpg\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" srcset=\"https://hzone.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Prolink_PMW5010_info_3.jpg 640w, https://hzone.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Prolink_PMW5010_info_3-600x212.jpg 600w, https://hzone.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Prolink_PMW5010_info_3-300x106.jpg 300w\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"226\" /></strong>\n\n\n\n<strong>How To Use</strong>\n\n<ol>\n\n \t<li>Insert the VGA Interface into the computer or other equipment with the VGA output</li>\n\n \t<li>Plug the USB and Audio connector to the relevent interfaces</li>\n\n \t<li>Connect the HDMI Cable to the HDMI female interface and then connect the HDMI cable to the displayer or projector with the HDMI interface.</li>\n\n</ol>\n\n<strong>Package Includes</strong> : HDMI-Compatible to VGA converter *1,USB cable*1,\n\nInstructions *1",
    "attributes": []
