    "description": "<p data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"577\">The <strong data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"383\">Aspor A382 Magnetic 10000mAh Wireless Power Bank</strong> is the perfect combination of portability, convenience, and power. Designed for modern mobile users, it features <strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"527\">wireless magnetic charging</strong> that makes powering your smartphone effortless.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"828\">With <strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"606\">10,000mAh capacity</strong>, this compact power bank ensures your devices stay charged all day. Its <strong data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"698\">dual USB output</strong> allows you to charge two devices simultaneously, while <strong data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"782\">fast charging technology</strong> delivers quick power when you need it most.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"1049\">The <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"866\">portable, lightweight design</strong> makes it easy to carry in your bag or pocket, making it ideal for <strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"968\">travel, office, or everyday use</strong>. Stay connected anytime, anywhere with the <strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1046\">Aspor A382 Wireless Power Bank</strong>.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1070\"><strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1068\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1336\">\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1115\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1115\">10000mAh capacity for long-lasting power</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1166\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1166\">Magnetic wireless charging for hassle-free use</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1192\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1192\">Fast charging support</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1240\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1240\">Dual USB output to charge 2 devices at once</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1272\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1272\">Compact and portable design</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1336\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1336\">Compatible with smartphones, tablets, and other USB devices</p>\n\n</li>\n\n</ul>",
