    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Material: ABS+PC</li>\n\n \t<li>Wireless Version: V5.3</li>\n\n \t<li>Communication Distance: 10m</li>\n\n \t<li>Playtime (Earphones Only): About 5 hours (volume at 70%)</li>\n\n \t<li>Playtime (With Charging Case): About 25 hours</li>\n\n \t<li>Charge Time: About 1.5 hours</li>\n\n \t<li>Charge Interface: Type-C</li>\n\n \t<li>Color: Cluster Black</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n6 Months Warranty",
    "description": "<h1>Baseus Bowie E17 True Wireless Bluetooth Earphones – Cluster Black – A00072200113-Z1</h1>\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"498\">Enjoy ultimate freedom and premium sound quality with the Baseus Bowie E17 True Wireless Bluetooth Earphones. Engineered for daily use with an ergonomic design, stable Bluetooth 5.3 connectivity, and extended battery life, they offer a seamless listening experience for music, calls, and entertainment on the go.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"516\">Key Features</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"743\"><strong data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"562\">Stable and Fast Bluetooth 5.3 Connection</strong><br data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"565\" />Powered by the latest Bluetooth V5.3 technology, the Bowie E17 ensures a fast, stable, and energy-efficient wireless connection up to 10 meters for uninterrupted music and calls.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"965\"><strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"778\">Long Playtime for All-Day Use</strong><br data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"781\" />Enjoy about 5 hours of continuous playtime on a single charge (at 70% volume), extended up to 25 hours with the compact charging case — perfect for travel, workouts, and long commutes.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1134\"><strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"997\">Superior Sound Performance</strong><br data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1000\" />With a frequency response range of 20Hz–20kHz, the earphones deliver balanced highs, mids, and lows for an immersive audio experience.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1313\"><strong data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1175\">Quick Charging and Type-C Interface</strong><br data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1178\" />The earphones and the case fully recharge in about 1.5 hours via a convenient Type-C charging port, ensuring you’re always ready to go.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1497\"><strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1353\">Lightweight and Comfortable Design</strong><br data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1356\" />Crafted from durable ABS+PC material, each earbud is lightweight, ergonomic, and designed for a secure and comfortable fit for extended wear.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1664\"><strong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1521\">Wide Compatibility</strong><br data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1524\" />Compatible with most wireless devices, including smartphones, tablets, and laptops, offering universal convenience for all your audio needs.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1853\"><strong data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1690\">Compact and Portable</strong><br data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1693\" />Sleek and stylish in Cluster Black, the Baseus Bowie E17 earphones fit easily into your pocket, backpack, or purse, making them your perfect everyday companion.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1878\">Specifications</h3>\n\n<ul data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"2511\">\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1924\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1924\"><strong data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1891\">Name:</strong> Baseus True Wireless Earphones</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1960\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1960\"><strong data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1941\">Model No.:</strong> Baseus Bowie E17</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1985\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1985\"><strong data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1976\">Material:</strong> ABS+PC</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2016\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2016\"><strong data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2009\">Wireless Version:</strong> V5.3</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2052\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2052\"><strong data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2046\">Communication Distance:</strong> 10m</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2117\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2117\"><strong data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2085\">Playtime (Earphones Only):</strong> About 5 hours (volume at 70%)</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2171\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2171\"><strong data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2154\">Playtime (With Charging Case):</strong> About 25 hours</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2254\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2254\"><strong data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2195\">Battery Capacity:</strong> 35mAh/0.129Wh (earphones), 430mAh/1.59Wh (charging case)</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2292\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2292\"><strong data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2282\">Earphone Rated Input:</strong> 5V⎓80mA</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2336\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2336\"><strong data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2325\">Charging Case Rated Input:</strong> 5V⎓430mA</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2373\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2373\"><strong data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2355\">Charge Time:</strong> About 1.5 hours</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2418\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2418\"><strong data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2405\">Frequency Response Range:</strong> 20Hz–20kHz</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2451\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2451\"><strong data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2442\">Charge Interface:</strong> Type-C</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2511\">\n\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2511\"><strong data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2471\">Suitable For:</strong> Compatible with most wireless devices</p>\n\n</li>\n\n</ul>",
