    "id": "32342",
    "name": "3366 Aluminum Tripod Stand For Camera & Mobile Phone",
    "sku": "WC-32342",
    "brand": "DWstore",
    "category": "Phone Holders",
    "regularPrice": 3400,
    "salePrice": 3400,
    "stock": 35,
    "status": "Active",
    "salesCount": 42,
    "rating": 4.8,
    "image": "/products/images/d3eb3fc0b5.webp",
    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li class=\"\">360 degree adjustment panoramic shooting</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp.product_detail.i1.2a7a1377mAFfPK\">Easy-to-install design quick-install panel</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\">Aluminum alloy material</li>\n\n</ul>",
    "description": "<h3>Portable Aluminum 3366 Tripod Universal Lightweight with Mobile Phone Holder – Perfect for Photography & Videography</h3>\n\nLooking for a reliable tripod to capture stunning photos and videos? The <strong>Portable Aluminum 3366 Tripod Universal Lightweight with Mobile Phone Holder</strong>, now available at <strong>GadgetCity.lk</strong>, is the ultimate solution for photographers and content creators. This lightweight, portable, and adjustable tripod is ideal for smartphones, DSLRs, and camcorders.\n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n\n<h4><strong>Why Choose the Portable Aluminum 3366 Tripod?</strong></h4>\n\n<ol>\n\n \t<li><strong>Lightweight & Portable Design</strong>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Crafted from durable <strong>aluminum alloy</strong>, this tripod weighs just 815 g, making it easy to carry anywhere.</li>\n\n \t<li>Foldable to a compact size of <strong>52 cm</strong>, it features a handy <strong>carrying handle</strong>, perfect for travel or outdoor shoots.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Adjustable Height for Versatile Angles</strong>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Enjoy flexible shooting with <strong>3-section telescoping legs</strong> and a middle-axis design.</li>\n\n \t<li>Extendable from <strong>50 cm to 140 cm</strong>, this tripod provides the perfect height for every situation.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Smooth & Flexible Operation</strong>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>The <strong>3D adjustable platform</strong> allows for precise angle adjustments to achieve your ideal shot.</li>\n\n \t<li>Equipped with a <strong>quick-release plate</strong> featuring a 1/4-inch screw for fast camera mounting and removal.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Wide Compatibility</strong>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>With a <strong>maximum load capacity of 3 kg</strong>, it supports <strong>DSLR cameras</strong>, digital cameras, camcorders, and more.</li>\n\n \t<li>Includes a <strong>mobile phone holder</strong>, making it perfect for vloggers and smartphone users.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n\n<h4><strong>Key Specifications</strong></h4>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Folded Height:</strong> 52 cm (20.5 inches)</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Maximum Height:</strong> 140 cm (53.1 inches)</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Minimum Height:</strong> 50 cm (19.7 inches)</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Leg Sections:</strong> 3</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 815 g (without packaging)</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Material:</strong> Durable Aluminum Alloy + ABS</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Max Load Capacity:</strong> 3 kg</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Screw Connector:</strong> 1/4 inch</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n\n<h4><strong>Additional Features</strong></h4>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Compact & Travel-Friendly:</strong> Fits easily into your travel gear with a folded dimension of 51 x 9 x 9.5 cm.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Quick-Fit Panel:</strong> Enables hassle-free setup in seconds.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Secure Shaft Lock:</strong> Keeps the tripod stable during use.</li>\n\n</ul>",
    "attributes": []
