    "description": "The Plokama PK-8899 Photography Tripod is the ideal companion for photographers and videographers. With its adjustable height, you can easily achieve the perfect shot, whether you’re shooting in the studio or on location. The tripod’s lightweight design, weighing only 1kg, makes it easy to carry without sacrificing stability. Constructed with high-quality materials, it ensures durability and stability for all your photography needs. The tripod is versatile and compatible with various cameras, camcorders, and other devices. Its compact folding size of 71.5cm allows for easy storage and transport, making it a convenient choice for any photographer.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-32422\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/download-78-300x300.webp\" alt=\"PLOKAMA PK-8899 Ring Light for makeup and live streaming\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-32425\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/download-75-300x300.webp\" alt=\"PLOKAMA PK-8899 Ring Light for makeup and live streaming\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />",
