    "description": "<b>USB WIRED COMBO</b>\n\n\n\nC100 wired keyboard and mouse set adopts ergonomic design,\n\nand the character surface adopts UV printing process,\n\n\n\nwhich can meet the needs of business office, greatly improve the operation efficiency,\n\nand ensure a longer service life.\n\n\n\nThe mouse DPI is 1000, which can meet the needs of business office. Whether it is in a quiet office\n\nstudying in the library,\n\n\n\nor working late at night, it will create a comfortable environment for you. Suitable for office\n\nhome, outdoor leisure and entertainment, etc.,\n\n\n\nit can easily cope with various occasions, and the comfortable and soft\n\ntouch coating will make you happy for a long time.\n\n\n\nThe USB interface is plug and play and\n\ncan serve you for a long time.\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https:/\numberonestore.net/image/catalog/PRODUCT/COMPUTER%20ACCESSOIRES/COMBO%20SET/MEETION/MT-C100/meetion-mt-c100-usb-wired-keyboard-and-mouse-combo-kit-for-computer-black-number-one-gaming-store-amman%20(1).jpg\" />\n\n\n\n<b>Waterproof design</b>\n\n\n\nThe keyboard is waterproof, you can continue to use it when the keyboard is accidentally\n\n\n\nsplashed with water, drinks and other liquids during use.\n\n\n\n<b>Mute button design</b>\n\n\n\nThe keyboard keys are silently designed, whether in a quiet office,Studying in the library or\n\n\n\nworking late at night will create a comfortable keystroke environment for you.\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https:/\numberonestore.net/image/catalog/PRODUCT/COMPUTER%20ACCESSOIRES/COMBO%20SET/MEETION/MT-C100/meetion-mt-c100-usb-wired-keyboard-and-mouse-combo-kit-for-computer-black-number-one-gaming-store-amman%20(7).jpg\" />\n\n\n\n<b>Matte soft-touch plastic</b>\n\n\n\nThe mouse has a pleasant matte finish that is not only comfortable to\n\nthe touch but also won't slip out of your\n\n\n\nhands even after prolonged use. And if you have wet wipes nearby\n\nthe traces will be wiped off in an instant.\n\n\n\n<b>Plug & Play</b>\n\n\n\nThe keyboard and mouse works autonomously and without the need to install additional software.\n\n\n\nWhen connected to a computer via a USB port, you can be up and running in seconds.",
