    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>300Mbps</strong> High-Speed WiFi Adapter</li>\n\n \t<li>Driver Free</li>\n\n \t<li>High Gain Signal Antena</li>\n\n \t<li>High Coverage</li>\n\n \t<li>Latest WiFi 6 Technology</li>\n\n \t<li>There is no driver for Win10/11, Plug & Play</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>6 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<h2>LB Link WiFi 6 USB WiFi Adapter BL-WN300AX</h2>\n\nBuy LB Link WiFi 6 USB WiFi Adapter BL-WN300AX in Sri Lanka. USB WiFi adapter from LB Link that utilizes the latest WiFi 6 technology. This adapter allows you to upgrade your existing computer or laptop to support faster and more reliable wireless connections.\n\n\n\nWith WiFi 6, you can experience speeds up to 3 times faster than the previous generation, making it ideal for streaming, online gaming, and other bandwidth-intensive activities.\n\n\n\nLB Link’s BL-WN300AX <a href=\"https://www.ido.lk/product/lb-link-usb-wifi-adapter-650mbps-dual-band-bl-wdn650a/\">USB WiFi adapter</a> is designed to provide a seamless and high-performance wireless connection for your devices. It offers enhanced coverage and stability, thanks to its advanced beamforming technology. This means that you can enjoy a strong and reliable WiFi signal even in areas with multiple devices or obstacles that may interfere with the signal.\n\n<h3>Features:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Wi-Fi 6 standard: With the latest <a href=\"https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/gaming/resources/wifi-6.html\">Wi-Fi 6</a> standard, the data transfer speed reaches 300Mbps, providing faster wireless connection speed.</li>\n\n \t<li>External high gain antenna: external high gain omnidirectional antenna, transmission distance is longer, wireless performance is more stable.</li>\n\n \t<li>Compatible with various operating systems: Compatible with Win7/Win10/Win11, Linux, and other major operating systems to meet the needs of users of various operating systems.</li>\n\n \t<li>There is no driver for Win10/11, Plug&Play.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Specifications:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Interface: USB 2.0</li>\n\n \t<li>Standard: IEEE 802.11b/g\n/ax</li>\n\n \t<li>Antenna Type: External Antenna</li>\n\n \t<li>Antenna Gain: 5dBi</li>\n\n \t<li>Frequency: 2.4~2.4835GHz</li>\n\n \t<li>Transmission power: 17dBm (max)</li>\n\n \t<li>Signal speed:\n\n– 11ax: up to 286.5GHz\n\n– 11ax: up to 286.8Mbps\n\n– 11n: up to 200Mbps\n\n– 11g: up to 54Mbps\n\n– 11b: up to 11Mbps /s</li>\n\n \t<li>Reception sensitivity:\n\n– 229M: reception: 5.5 Mbps\n\n– 229M: RX: 5-65 at ten percent PER\n\n– 115M: RX: 5-68 at ten percent PER\n\n– 150M: RX:s-70@ten percent PER\n\n– 72.2M: RX: 5-72 at ten percent PER\n\n– 54M: RX: 5-74 dBm at ten percent PER\n\n– 11M: RX: 5-88 dBm at eight percent PER</li>\n\n \t<li>Wireless Mode: Station</li>\n\n \t<li>Modulation Type: CCK/ DOPSK/DBPSK/BPSK/OPSK/16-0AM/64-OAM/256-OAM/1024-0AM</li>\n\n \t<li>Wireless Security: WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, WPAWPA2.</li>\n\n \t<li>OS support: Win7/Win10/Win11</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter entered lazyloaded\" src=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/D5612AQFtWhvY2ZbLHw/article-cover_image-shrink_720_1280/0/1695629050656?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=qS3ZbVer4HTcxeB6l8FnRM8jLBBJFjOWT2gxjn1O5UA\" alt=\"LB Link WiFi 6 USB WiFi Adapter BL-WN300AX in Sri Lanka | ido.lk\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" data-lazy-src=\"//media.licdn.com/dms/image/D5612AQFtWhvY2ZbLHw/article-cover_image-shrink_720_1280/0/1695629050656?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=qS3ZbVer4HTcxeB6l8FnRM8jLBBJFjOWT2gxjn1O5UA\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" /><img class=\"aligncenter entered lazyloaded\" src=\"https://image.made-in-china.com/2f0j00bvjoFyQJyTqc/LB-LINK-BL-WN300AX-WiFi-6-AX300-WiFi-USB-Dongle-OEM-300Mbps-Speed-2-4GHz-High-Speed-for-PC-Gaming-Streaming-WiFi-Connector-Adapter.webp\" alt=\"LB Link WiFi 6 USB WiFi Adapter BL-WN300AX in Sri Lanka | ido.lk\" width=\"3840\" height=\"3302\" data-lazy-src=\"//image.made-in-china.com/2f0j00bvjoFyQJyTqc/LB-LINK-BL-WN300AX-WiFi-6-AX300-WiFi-USB-Dongle-OEM-300Mbps-Speed-2-4GHz-High-Speed-for-PC-Gaming-Streaming-WiFi-Connector-Adapter.webp\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" /><img class=\"aligncenter entered lazyloaded\" src=\"https://image.made-in-china.com/2f0j00cCjbOvTMLEqo/LB-LINK-BL-WN300AX-WiFi-6-AX300-WiFi-USB-Dongle-OEM-300Mbps-Speed-2-4GHz-High-Speed-for-PC-Gaming-Streaming-WiFi-Connector-Adapter.webp\" alt=\"LB Link WiFi 6 USB WiFi Adapter BL-WN300AX in Sri Lanka | ido.lk\" width=\"3840\" height=\"3302\" data-lazy-src=\"//image.made-in-china.com/2f0j00cCjbOvTMLEqo/LB-LINK-BL-WN300AX-WiFi-6-AX300-WiFi-USB-Dongle-OEM-300Mbps-Speed-2-4GHz-High-Speed-for-PC-Gaming-Streaming-WiFi-Connector-Adapter.webp\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" /><img class=\"aligncenter entered lazyloaded\" src=\"https://www.ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/352fee7714bcd2c09eb8ebb8fffb6dc3.webp\" alt=\"LB Link WiFi 6 USB WiFi Adapter BL-WN300AX in Sri Lanka | ido.lk\" width=\"2560\" height=\"6611\" data-lazy-src=\"//www.ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/352fee7714bcd2c09eb8ebb8fffb6dc3.webp\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" />",
