    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Brand New Chipset Realtek 8188</li>\n\n \t<li>Exceptional wireless speed up to 150Mbps</li>\n\n \t<li>External 5dBi omnidirectional antenna, wireless signal transfer more stably</li>\n\n \t<li>Security support for 64/128 WEP, WPA/WPA2/WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</li>\n\n \t<li>Seamlessly compatible with 802.11b/g\n devices</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>6 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<img class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https://ijrorwxhkqmllp5m-static.micyjz.com/cloud/lnBpoKqpljSRnkloillrjq/qiepian1.jpg\" alt=\"WN155A 150Mbps High Gain Wireless USB Adapter\" width=\"100%\" data-original=\"//ijrorwxhkqmllp5m-static.micyjz.com/cloud/lnBpoKqpljSRnkloillrjq/qiepian1.jpg\" />\n\n\n\nPowerful Connection, Powerful High Gain Wi-Fi\n\n\n\n<strong>Enjoy the internet without a network cable, even on a computer</strong>\n\n\n\nUnable to connect to wireless network on your desktop computer and the network cable is too far away? Bad Wi-Fi signal on your laptop's built-in network card? All you need is a wireless network card to receive Wi-Fi signal and connect to the internet without any cable hassle.\n\n\n\n<strong>Free and clever, allowing signal adjustment at will</strong>\n\n\n\nFlexible and versatile antenna structure design, supporting multidimensional free rotation, allows users to adjust according to usage habits and signal strength, improve signal sensitivity, and enjoy smooth network at any time.\n\n\n\n<strong>11N wireless technology</strong>\n\n\n\nThe BL-WN155A utilizes 11N wireless technology with a wireless transmission speed of up to 150Mbps, enabling more efficient data transmission, smoother video/audio streaming, and better network gaming performance within a local area network.\n\n\n\n<strong>Advanced encryption, security assurance</strong>\n\n\n\nThe BL-WN155A supports WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, WPA/WPA2 security mechanisms, and WEP encryption, providing better all-around protection for your wireless network security.",
