    "image": "/products/images/163d5c7ce5.webp",
    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>1.83inch waterproof smart watch with 100+ stylish watch faces</li>\n\n \t<li>123 fitness tracking modes for your workout needs</li>\n\n \t<li>All day tracking for heart rate, SpO2, sleep quality and stree level</li>\n\n \t<li>Handfree calls, message alert and smart voice control</li>\n\n \t<li>IP67 waterproof, wide compatibility with Android and iOS</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>6 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<div id=\"Features\" class=\"pws_list\">\n\n<div class=\"pws_i_act\">\n\n<p class=\"s50 after\">1.83 inch Hi-Res TFT Touch Screen</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s16 after\">\n\n\n\nBWOO 1.83 inch waterproof smart watch features a 1.83 inch TFT touch screen with a high resolution of 240x284, making it beautiful and easy to read. Combining with a stylish appearance and 100+ stylish watch faces, it is also a trendy item for you to accessorize your style.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pws_i_img\">\n\n<div class=\"pws_i_act\">\n\n<p class=\"s50 after\">123 Sports Modes Fitness Tracker</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s16 after\">\n\n\n\nElevate your sports lifestyle with our BWOO waterproof smart watch. With more than 123 sports modes available to choose from, it can easily meet all kinds of workout needs including running, walking, jumping ropes, swimming, Yoga, and more. Rated at IP67 waterproof resistance, this 1.83 inch waterproof smart watch is sweatproof and can easily handle water damage even being sunk underwater 10 meters, making it a perfect fitness tracker for adults and teens.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pws_i_img_list s_pws\">\n\n<div class=\"bo_img after\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20240522/17163715274250850.jpg\" alt=\"BWOO smart watch Screen\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_img after\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20240522/17163715272454443.jpg\" alt=\"BWOO smart watch features\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_img after\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20240522/17163715272043145.jpg\" alt=\"BWOO smart watch monitor\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_container s_pws\">\n\n<div class=\"bo_left\">\n\n<div class=\"bo_act\">\n\n<p class=\"s18 after\">Monitor your health</p>\n\n<p class=\"s30 after\">Multifunctional Health Tracker</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s16 after\">\n\n\n\nMonitor your health with the BWOO smart watch. It is built with an intelligent biosensor that enables more accurate tracking for heart rate monitoring, SpO2 detection, sleep tracking, and blood pressure testing, delivering a deeper insight into your body's health. It can also accurately counts your steps, calories, and distance while detecting your health status so you can have a detailed look at activities throughout the day.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_right after\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20240522/17163714849680480.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ba_b_wrap \">\n\n<div class=\"bba_con s_pws\">\n\n<div class=\"ba_swiper_left\">\n\n<div class=\"ba_swiper swiper-container swiper-container-initialized swiper-container-horizontal after\">\n\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20240522/17163715538748538.jpg\" alt=\"BWOO smart watch call\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-prev\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20240522/17163715536483034.jpg\" alt=\"BWOO smart watch voice\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-active\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20240522/17163715541646950.jpg\" alt=\"BWOO smart watch IP67\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pws_pag after\">\n\n<div class=\"pws_btn ba_btn_l\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/static/home/images/jiantoushang_left.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"swiper-pagination ba_pag swiper-pagination-bullets\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"pws_btn ba_btn_r swiper-button-disabled\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next slide\" aria-disabled=\"true\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/static/home/images/jiantoushang_right.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bab_right \">\n\n<div class=\"bab_img after\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20240522/17163714844056029.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"bab_act\">\n\n<p class=\"s30 after\">Handfree Calls & Message Alert</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s18 after\">\n\n\n\nKeep connected with the world by pairing it with this BWOO smart watch for Android through BT5.2 connectivity tech. This fitness smart watch allows you to answer/make calls, receive message alerts, control music playback, and check the weather simply with a tap. Besides, more functions including sedentary reminders, menstrual management, and finding my phone, are available to meet your different scenario needs. Tap the screen to activate the assistant for smarter control.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_container s_pws bo_s_con\">\n\n<div class=\"bo_left\">\n\n<div class=\"bo_act\">\n\n<p class=\"s18 after\">​Wide compatibility with Android and iOS</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s18 after\">\n\n\n\nBWOO smart watch for Android iPhone is compatible with Android and iOS systems. It can work well on a variety of smartwatches whose operation system is Android V5.0 or its older versions as well as iOS 9.0 system and its previous versions. Boasting a 230mAh battery with a high safety performance, it can provide up to 5 to 7 days of battery life with regular use.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bo_right after\"><img src=\"https://bwoohk.com/upload/images/product/20240522/17163714844092264.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\n</div>",
