    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>2.01\" HD Display</li>\n\n \t<li>Shortcut Card Design</li>\n\n \t<li>Advanced Bluetooth 5.3</li>\n\n \t<li>Bluetooth Calling</li>\n\n \t<li>150+ Watch Faces</li>\n\n \t<li>127 Workout Modes</li>\n\n \t<li>Health Monitoring</li>\n\n \t<li>7 Day Batter Life</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>6 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<h5>Smooth and Silky Visuals</h5>\n\nIndulge in crystal-clear imagery on the 2.01\" HD colourful display with broader viewing space.\n\n<h5>Bluetooth Calling</h5>\n\nEasily make/answer calls or check call records on the watch, whether you are doing outdoor sports or housework.\n\n<h5>Smart Message Notifications</h5>\n\nStay updated with real-time notifications. Enjoy remote shutter and music control features.\n\n<h5>Advanced Bluetooth 5.3</h5>\n\nEnjoy fast, stable connections and low power consumption with HAYLOU Watch S6's advanced Bluetooth 5.3 chip.\n\n<h5>150+ Watch Faces</h5>\n\nUnlock your style with over 150 unique watch faces to suit any mood or occasion.\n\n<h5>Upgraded View Modes</h5>\n\nUncover limitless possibilities with HAYLOU Watch S6's six dynamic view modes and streamlined shortcut card design, ensuring swift access to weather, sports, health, and beyond.\n\n<h5>127 Workout Modes</h5>\n\nLive an active life with this all-around personal coach who provides accurate data and scientific training guidance.\n\n<h5>Trusted Health Guardian</h5>\n\nTake control of your well-being with HAYLOU Watch S6. In real-time, monitor key health metrics like heart rate, SpO2 levels, sleep patterns, and stress. Designed to support your active lifestyle, it also tracks menstrual cycles and offers guided breathing exercises to reduce fatigue and enhance relaxation.\n\n<h5>Voice Assistant</h5>\n\nAccess the voice assistant instantly by voice command for tasks like making calls, opening apps, and receiving news updates.\n\n<h5>Professional Water Resistance</h5>\n\nThe HAYLOU Watch S6 has gone through the waterproof test in harsh environments. With an IP68 waterproof rating, it can withstand all your daily activities.\n\n<h2 class=\"s6-section-title\">Long-lasting Battery Life</h2>\n\n<div>Experience up to 20 days of uninterrupted usage on a single charge in basic mode, ensuring you can train without interruption.</div>\n\n<div class=\"s6-s12-card-wrp\">\n\n<div class=\"s6-s12-card-div\">\n\n<div class=\"s6-card-s12-title\">7 days</div>\n\n<div>Daily use</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"s6-s12-card-div\">\n\n<div class=\"s6-card-s12-title\">20 days</div>\n\n<div>Basic standby</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"s6-note is-s12-note1\">* Daily usage mode: all-day heart rate and sleep monitoring; incoming call reminder three times a day; Bluetooth calls 15 minutes a week; message reminder 100 times a day; raise-to wake 150 times a day; exercise three times a week and 30-minute run each time; SpO2 tracking twice a day.</div>\n\n<div class=\"s6-note is-s12-note2\">* Basic usage mode: default watch face; all-day sleep monitoring; turn off phone Bluetooth connection; continuous heart rate monitoring and other functions.</div>\n\n<h5>Package List</h5>\n\nHAYLOU Watch S6 watch x1\n\nCharging cable x1\n\nUser manual x1",
