    "description": "<p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"495\">The <strong data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"261\">ASPOR A909 USB PD 22.5W Car Charger</strong> is the perfect travel companion for fast and reliable charging on the go. With <strong data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"370\">22.5W Power Delivery (PD)</strong> and <strong data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"402\">Quick Charge technology</strong>, it ensures your smartphones, tablets, and other devices power up quickly while you drive.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"882\">Equipped with a <strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"540\">USB-A and Type-C output</strong>, the A909 supports multiple devices simultaneously, making it convenient for daily commutes or long road trips. Its <strong data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"675\">compact design</strong> fits easily into any car’s power socket, while built-in <strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"754\">safety protections</strong> guard against overheating, overcharging, and short circuits. Stay powered up wherever you go with the Aspor A909 Car Charger.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"882\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-32653\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/download-2025-09-25T163036.558-327x300.webp\" alt=\"Aspor A909 car charger dual port USB and Type-C\" width=\"327\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-32654\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/download-2025-09-25T162952.567-300x300.webp\" alt=\"Aspor A909 car charger dual port USB and Type-C\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></p>",
