    "description": "Comfortable In-Ear Design】Featuring a secure in-ear design with silicone ear tips to prevent sound leakage and ensure a comfortable, stable fit\n\n【HIFI High-Fidelity Sound】Experience premium audio quality with built-in panoramic surround sound effects for an immersive listening experience\n\n【Advanced Bluetooth-compatible 5.4 Chip】Equipped with the latest Bluetooth-compatible 5.4 technology for improved battery life, transmission quality, audio fidelity, and reduced latency\n\n【Dual Mode Functionality】Easily switch between gaming and music modes with a single touch for optimized performance in different scenarios\n\n【Extended Battery Life】Enjoy up to 4 hours of talk time and 12 hours of standby time for long-lasting use throughout the day\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H25ed929c6bb24c3a91f969e0a87e7182C/223084980/H25ed929c6bb24c3a91f969e0a87e7182C.jpg\" />",
