    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Brand: Remax</li>\n\n \t<li>Model: W26 Earbuds</li>\n\n \t<li>Clear sound with balanced bass and treble</li>\n\n \t<li>Bluetooth 5.0 for a reliable and fast connection</li>\n\n \t<li>Touch controls for easy music and call management</li>\n\n \t<li>Up to 5 hours of playback, with additional power from the case</li>\n\n \t<li>Ergonomic design for a comfortable fit</li>\n\n \t<li>USB-C charging for fast and convenient power-ups</li>\n\n \t<li>No warranty for water damage or physical damage</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4><strong data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1392\" data-is-last-node=\"\">6 Months Warranty</strong></h4>",
    "description": "<p data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"4027\">The <strong data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3751\">Remax W26 Earbuds</strong> are designed for music lovers, gamers, and professionals who want <strong data-start=\"3818\" data-end=\"3864\">superior audio quality and all-day comfort</strong>. With <strong data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3901\">Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity</strong>, they deliver a <strong data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3968\">fast, stable, and seamless wireless connection</strong>, ensuring smooth music playback and crystal-clear calls.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"4029\" data-end=\"4341\">The <strong data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4063\">high-quality sound drivers</strong> produce <strong data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4107\">balanced bass, mids, and treble</strong>, making every song, podcast, or call sound crisp and immersive. Thanks to their <strong data-start=\"4188\" data-end=\"4220\">compact and ergonomic design</strong>, the W26 earbuds fit comfortably in your ears, making them perfect for workouts, commutes, or long listening sessions.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"4343\" data-end=\"4553\">With <strong data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4376\">intuitive touch controls</strong>, you can manage volume, skip tracks, answer calls, and activate voice assistants without reaching for your phone. The <strong data-start=\"4495\" data-end=\"4518\">built-in microphone</strong> ensures clear, hands-free calls.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4805\">Enjoy up to <strong data-start=\"4567\" data-end=\"4601\">5 hours of continuous playtime</strong>, with additional charges from the portable case extending usage throughout the day. Built with <strong data-start=\"4697\" data-end=\"4732\">IPX5 sweat and water resistance</strong>, the W26 earbuds are reliable for gym workouts and outdoor activities.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4943\">The <strong data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4836\">quick pairing feature</strong> makes setup effortless across smartphones, tablets, and laptops, giving you versatility wherever you go.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"4970\">Key Features</h3>\n\n<ul data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"5488\">\n\n \t<li data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"5030\">\n\n<p data-start=\"4974\" data-end=\"5030\"><strong data-start=\"4974\" data-end=\"4991\">Bluetooth 5.0</strong> – Fast & stable wireless connection.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"5031\" data-end=\"5100\">\n\n<p data-start=\"5033\" data-end=\"5100\"><strong data-start=\"5033\" data-end=\"5055\">High-Quality Audio</strong> – Clear sound with balanced bass & treble.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"5101\" data-end=\"5165\">\n\n<p data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5165\"><strong data-start=\"5103\" data-end=\"5121\">Touch Controls</strong> – Manage music, calls & volume with ease.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5233\">\n\n<p data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5233\"><strong data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5189\">Long Battery Life</strong> – 5 hours per charge, extended with case.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"5234\" data-end=\"5297\">\n\n<p data-start=\"5236\" data-end=\"5297\"><strong data-start=\"5236\" data-end=\"5263\">Sweat & Water Resistant</strong> – IPX5 for workouts & outdoors.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"5298\" data-end=\"5353\">\n\n<p data-start=\"5300\" data-end=\"5353\"><strong data-start=\"5300\" data-end=\"5323\">Built-in Microphone</strong> – Clear hands-free calling.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"5354\" data-end=\"5420\">\n\n<p data-start=\"5356\" data-end=\"5420\"><strong data-start=\"5356\" data-end=\"5379\">Compact & Ergonomic</strong> – Lightweight comfort for all-day use.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"5421\" data-end=\"5488\">\n\n<p data-start=\"5423\" data-end=\"5488\"><strong data-start=\"5423\" data-end=\"5440\">Quick Pairing</strong> – Fast connection with smartphones & devices.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<img src=\"https://sc04.alicdn.com/kf/Hb868114c69c6487785c522047613e00bs/223084980/Hb868114c69c6487785c522047613e00bs.jpg\" />",
