    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Brand: GOOP</li>\n\n \t<li>Model: AA 2600mWh 1.5V</li>\n\n \t<li>Cell type: Rechargeable</li>\n\n \t<li>Battery cell composition: Ni-Mah</li>\n\n \t<li>Unit count: 2 Count (1 Pair)</li>\n\n \t<li>High Capacity: With a capacity of 2600 mWh, these batteries offer a long-lasting charge suitable for devices that require consistent power, such as flashlights, cameras, headlamps, doorbells, RC cars, and sound equipment.</li>\n\n \t<li>Rechargeable via Type-C USB Port: The batteries come with a built-in Type-C USB port, allowing for easy recharging without the need for a separate charger. This makes them very convenient for on-the-go use.</li>\n\n \t<li>Multiple Device Compatibility: These AA-sized batteries are compatible with a wide range of electronic devices, making them a versatile choice for various applications.</li>\n\n</ul>",
