    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Not just a 4G USB modem, but also a USB Wi-Fi router.</li>\n\n \t<li>Wireless access works on 3G, 4G and Wi-Fi networks.</li>\n\n \t<li>Convenient and portable, 4GDONG001 is easy to use and stylish.</li>\n\n \t<li>High-speed internet access for office and home.</li>\n\n \t<li>It can also be used with laptops, notebooks, UMPCs and MID devices.</li>\n\n \t<li>Simply insert a SIM card to act as a wireless router, no setup required.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>6 Months Warranty</h4>",
