    "description": "<strong>1. High Capacity 20000mAh:</strong>\n\nWith an impressive <strong>20000mAh capacity</strong>, the Aspor A336 provides multiple charges for your devices, making it ideal for travel, work, and everyday use.(Rated capacity 12000mAh)\n\n\n\n<strong>2. 22.5W PD + QC 3.0 Fast Charging:</strong>\n\nExperience ultra-fast charging with <strong>22.5W Power Delivery (PD)</strong> and <strong>Quick Charge 3.0 (QC 3.0)</strong> technology. Recharge your smartphones, tablets, and other devices quickly and efficiently.\n\n\n\n<strong>3. LCD Display for Battery Monitoring:</strong>\n\nThe built-in <strong>LCD display</strong> shows the remaining battery level at a glance, ensuring you never run out of power unexpectedly.\n\n\n\n<strong>4. Multiple Input and Output Ports:</strong>\n\nFeaturing <strong>2 input ports</strong> and <strong>3 output ports</strong>, this power bank offers versatile charging options. Charge multiple devices simultaneously with ease.\n\n\n\n<strong>5. Compact and Durable Design:</strong>\n\nThe Aspor A336 combines portability and durability, making it the perfect companion for on-the-go charging.\n\n\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-32730\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/download-2025-09-29T135341.391-300x300.webp\" alt=\"ASPOR A336 portable 22.5W PD power bank with USB & Type-C\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-32728\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/download-2025-09-29T135404.370-297x300.webp\" alt=\"ASPOR A336 portable 22.5W PD power bank with USB & Type-C\" width=\"297\" height=\"300\" />",
