    "description": "<p data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"467\">Enjoy premium sound quality with the <strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"323\">UiiSii C100 Wired 3.5mm Super Bass Earphones Handsfree</strong>. Designed with <strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"364\">powerful bass drivers</strong>, these earphones deliver crystal-clear audio with deep, rich bass for an immersive music experience.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"665\">The lightweight and ergonomic design ensures a <strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"535\">comfortable fit</strong> for long listening sessions, while the <strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"616\">in-line microphone and control button</strong> allow you to manage calls and music with ease.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"877\">Compatible with all devices that feature a <strong data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"730\">3.5mm audio jack</strong>, the UiiSii C100 is perfect for smartphones, laptops, MP3 players, and more. Built with <strong data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"845\">durable cable material</strong>, it ensures long-lasting use.</p>",
