    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Lenovo's newest design gaming earphones. Top gaming chip design</li>\n\n \t<li>Music/Game dual mode,sound quality synchronization and low latency</li>\n\n \t<li>Bluetooth V5.3, support most of Bluetooth devices and lower power consumption</li>\n\n \t<li>ENC call noise reduction effectively suppress environmental noise.</li>\n\n \t<li data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2g0o.detail.1000023.i0.7db36mdn6mdn9X\">Single and binaural use independently,regardless of master-slave switch arbitrarily.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>3 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<section id=\"shopify-section-template--24771795779967__c36ee1da-9d09-4226-9f00-184ea31b35eb\" class=\"shopify-section\">\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs section animation animation--product-tabs is-visible\" data-section-id=\"template--24771795779967__c36ee1da-9d09-4226-9f00-184ea31b35eb\" data-section-type=\"product-tabs\" data-tab-alignment=\"center\">\n\n<div class=\"section-inner\">\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs__inner\">\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs__tab-list-wrapper\">\n\n<ul class=\"product-tabs__tab-list animation--item\" data-tab-list=\"\">\n\n \t<li id=\"product-tab--template--21392692216101__c36ee1da-9d09-4226-9f00-184ea31b35eb-product_description-1\" class=\"product-tabs__tab-item\" aria-hidden=\"false\" data-tab-item=\"\">\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs__tab-item-content\">\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs__tab-column-wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs__tab-column\">\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs__tab-text-container\">\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs__tab-text ff-body rte fs-body-100\">\n\n\n\n<strong>Enhanced Immersion</strong>: Lenovo earphones provide surround sound for a more immersive experience, thanks to their 10mm drivers delivering richly detailed and bass-toned audio.\n\n\n\n<strong>Reliable Connectivity</strong>: With Bluetooth version 5.3, the GM2 Pro ensures a swift, stable, and interference-free connection within a 10-meter range. Each earphone can also connect independently, allowing for versatile usage.\n\n\n\n<strong>GM2 Pro offers 2 customizable modes</strong>: Music mode enhances your songs, while Gaming mode ensures low latency for synchronized audio and video.\n\n\n\n<strong>Extended Use and Noise Reduction</strong>: These earphones feature a 40mAh rechargeable battery, offering up to 5 hours of continuous operation on a single charge. Additionally, the 350mAh charging case extends this to a total of 30 hours of use. Quick charging of the GM2 Pro takes only 1.5 hours, and Lenovo earphones reduce ambient noise for clear conversations.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs__tab-column-wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs__tab-column\">\n\n<div class=\"product-tabs__tab-text-container\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div></li>\n\n \t<li id=\"product-tab--template--21392692216101__c36ee1da-9d09-4226-9f00-184ea31b35eb-one_column-1\" class=\"product-tabs__tab-item\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-tab-item=\"\"><span style=\"color: #1b1919; font-size: 24px;\">Overview</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</section><section id=\"shopify-section-template--24771795779967__e52d2c06-f146-4cf3-9a95-b8945de6bec9\" class=\"shopify-section\">\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n\n<div class=\"section-inner\"><center><img src=\"https://www.bsavvi.co.uk/cdn/shop/files/lenovo-gm2-pro-wireless-earphones-bluetooth-5-3-overview-1-bsavvi.jpg?v=1694289366\" /><center><img src=\"https://www.bsavvi.co.uk/cdn/shop/files/lenovo-gm2-pro-wireless-earphones-bluetooth-5-3-overview-2-bsavvi.jpg?v=1694289366\" /><center><img src=\"https://www.bsavvi.co.uk/cdn/shop/files/lenovo-gm2-pro-wireless-earphones-bluetooth-5-3-overview-3-bsavvi.jpg?v=1694289366\" /><center><img src=\"https://www.bsavvi.co.uk/cdn/shop/files/lenovo-gm2-pro-wireless-earphones-bluetooth-5-3-overview-4-bsavvi.jpg?v=1694289365\" /></center></center></center></center></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</section>",
