    "description": "<p data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"521\">Experience superior charging and data transfer performance with the <strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"359\">Aspor AC-26XL USB to Lightning Cable (3m)</strong>. Designed for Apple devices, this <strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"422\">extra-long 3-meter cable</strong> offers maximum convenience whether you’re working, gaming, or relaxing away from the plug point.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"764\">Made with <strong data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"568\">high-quality copper core wiring</strong> and a <strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"597\">durable PVC jacket</strong>, it ensures fast, safe, and stable power delivery. The <strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"678\">reinforced connectors</strong> resist wear and tear, providing long-lasting reliability even with heavy daily use.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"960\">Perfect for <strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"804\">iPhone, iPad, and iPod</strong> devices, the <strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"835\">Aspor AC-26XL</strong> supports both <strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"873\">high-speed charging</strong> and <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"902\">data synchronization</strong>, making it an essential accessory for every Apple user.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"983\">⚡ <strong data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"981\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1205\">\n\n \t<li data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1034\">\n\n<p data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1034\">3m extra-long Lightning cable for flexible use</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1077\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1077\">Fast charging and high-speed data sync</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1109\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1109\">Durable, tangle-free design</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1157\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1157\">Reinforced connectors for extended lifespan</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1205\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1205\">Compatible with all Apple Lightning devices</p>\n\n</li>\n\n</ul>",
