    "id": "32883",
    "name": "Baseus Adaman2 PD fast Charge Power Bank 30W 10000mAh",
    "sku": "WC-32883",
    "brand": "Baseus",
    "category": "Power Banks",
    "regularPrice": 9200,
    "salePrice": 8750,
    "stock": 35,
    "status": "Active",
    "salesCount": 7,
    "rating": 4.8,
    "image": "/products/images/647859606e.webp",
    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>10000mAh large capacity. Allows multiple recharges.</li>\n\n \t<li>Fast charge. The power bank supports many fast-charging standards, including SCP, Power Delivery, and Quick Charge.</li>\n\n \t<li>Charge 3 devices at once. Built-in output jacks allow you to connect and charge 3 devices at the same time.</li>\n\n \t<li>Built-in digital display. Indicates the current battery level.</li>\n\n \t<li>built-in security. The power bank protects the phone from overvoltage, short circuit, magnetic field influence, electrostatic field influence, overheating, excessive battery charge.</li>\n\n \t<li>Charge with power up to 30W. Thanks to the use of high power, it shortens the time needed to fully charge the battery.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>6 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<div><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0555/8432/5709/files/PPAD040101Adaman2_powerbank30W10000mAh_a3_2048x2048.jpg?v=1672924995\" alt=\"Baseus Adaman2 Power Bank 30W 10000mAh\" /><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0555/8432/5709/files/PPAD040101Adaman2_powerbank30W10000mAh_a1_2048x2048.jpg?v=1672924996\" alt=\"Baseus Adaman2 Power Bank 30W 10000mAh\" /></div>\n\n<div></div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Palm-sized and portable</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.5pt; color: #0f1111;\">Pocketable and easy to carry. This USB C portable charger is small enough to slip into your pocket and the matte black plastic that's comfortable to hold.</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Recharge in a flash</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.5pt; color: #0f1111;\">This battery pack charger portable can be fully charged in just about 2hrs 45mins with a PD charger of 18W or above (not included).</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Airline friendly</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.5pt; color: #0f1111;\">Our safety system combines overcharge/overheat protection and more to keep you and your devices safe.<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0555/8432/5709/files/PPAD040101Adaman2_powerbank30W10000mAh_a_2048x2048.jpg?v=1672924449\" alt=\"Baseus Adaman2 Power Bank 30W 10000mAh\" /></div>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Baseus Portable Charger USB C 30W 10000mAh</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.5pt; color: #0f1111;\"><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">The great companion for iPhone 13 Pro Max & MacBook Air</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;\"></p>\n\n\n\n<ul style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\n\n \t<li style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #0f1111;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.5pt;\">Fast charge your phone, even the laptop - By using the 30W USB C port of this portable charger, you can fast charge your iPhone 13 Pro Max to 60% in 30 minutes with full speed 27W. It can also charge the MacBook Air to 50% in 55 minutes.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;\"></p>\n\n\n\n<ul style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\n\n \t<li style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #0f1111;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.5pt;\">Small but powerful - The 10000mAh capacity of this phone battery bank provides 1.8 charges for iPhone 14 Pro, 1.5 charges for iPhone 13 Pro Max, 1 charge for iPad mini 6, and 0.8 charges for MacBook Air.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0555/8432/5709/files/PPAD040101Adaman2_powerbank30W10000mAh_9_2048x2048.jpg?v=1672924561\" alt=\"Baseus Adaman2 Power Bank 30W 10000mAh\" /></p>\n\nCompatibility:\n\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n\n \t<li>iPhone 14, iPhone 14 Plus, iPhone 14 Pro, iPhone 14 Pro Max</li>\n\n \t<li>30W fast charging - MacBook Air, iPad series.</li>\n\n \t<li>27W fast charging - iPhone 13 Pro Max.</li>\n\n \t<li>20W/18W fast charging - iPhone 13, iPhone 13 Pro, iPhone 13 mini, iPhone 12, iPhone 12 Pro, iPhone 12 Pro Max, iPhone 12 mini, iPhone 11 series, iPhone X / XS / XS Max / XR, iPhone 8 / 8 Plus, iPhone SE (3rd/2nd generation), iPad series.</li>\n\n \t<li>PPS, PD, and QC fast charging - Samsung Galaxy series, Google pixel series, others.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n \n\n\n\n10000 mAh capacity provides:\n\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n\n \t<li>About 1.5 iPhone 13 Pro Max charges, 0.8 MacBook Air charges.</li>\n\n \t<li>About 1.8 iPhone 14 charges, 1.5 iPhone 14 Plus charges, 1.8 iPhone 14 Pro charges, 1.5 iPhone 14 Pro Max charges.</li>\n\n \t<li>About 1.8 iPhone 13 charges, 1.85 iPhone 13 Pro charges, 2.4 iPhone 13 mini charges, 2 iPhone 12 charges, 2 iPhone12 Pro charges, 1.5 iPhone 12 Pro Max charges, 2.6 iPhone 12 mini charges.</li>\n\n \t<li>About 1.1 S22 Ultra charges, 1.6 S22 charges, 1.1 S21 Ultra charges, 1.4 S21 charges.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">What You Get:</span></p>\n\n\n\n<ul style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\n\n \t<li style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #0f1111;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.5pt;\">Baseus Portable Charger USB C</span></li>\n\n \t<li style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle; color: #0f1111;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.5pt;\">USB-A to USB-C cable</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.5pt; color: #0f1111;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Notes:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11.5pt; color: #0f1111;\">It is recommended to use the USB-A port to charge low-current devices (such as earbuds).</p>",
