    "shortDesc": "<ul class=\"list-disc pb-4 sm\">\n\n \t<li>Wide frequency response from 20Hz to 40kHz for detailed sound reproduction.</li>\n\n \t<li>Low impedance of 16 Ω for efficient power usage.</li>\n\n \t<li>Lightweight at 14.3g with a compact 9mm dynamic driver for comfortable wear.</li>\n\n \t<li>Features a microphone with a sensitivity of -42 dBV/Pa @1kHz for clear voice capture.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>3 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<div class=\"lifestyle-feature\">\n\n\n\n<strong>Hi-Res Audio with JBL Pure Bass Sound. Now available to go.</strong>\n\n\n\nIntroducing JBL Tune 310C USB-C in-ear headphones. They’re lightweight, comfortable and compact. A pair of 9mm dynamic drivers punch out powerful JBL Pure Bass Sound, while the High-Resolution Audio support ensures great sound quality. A USB-C connection makes them compatible with a large variety of devices like PCs, mobiles, and gaming devices. In addition, the three-button remote on a tangle-free flat cable lets you control music playback and volume adjustment, EQ presets, as well as answering calls on the fly with a built-in microphone. All this makes the JBL Tune 310C USB-C your everyday companion, at work, at home, and on the road.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lifestyle-feature\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"lifestyle-feature\"><picture class=\"carousel-images-container\"><img src=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dwb4df7dfa/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Red_1.png?sw=904&sh=560\" alt=\"JBL Tune 310C USB JBL Pure Bass sound, Hi-Res certified - Image\" /></picture>\n\n<div class=\"feature-text\">\n\n<h3>JBL Pure Bass sound, Hi-Res certified</h3>\n\nFor over 75 years, JBL has engineered the precise, impressive sound found in big venues around the world. These headphones reproduce that same JBL sound, punching out bass that’s deep, powerful. Hi-Res Audio brings clear and detailed sound quality with a wide frequency range.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lifestyle-feature\"><picture class=\"carousel-images-container\"><source srcset=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310 USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=1356&sh=840, https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310 USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=2034&sh=1260 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px)\" /><source srcset=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310 USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=904&sh=560, https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310 USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=1356&sh=840 2x \" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199.98px)\" /><source srcset=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310 USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=904&sh=560, https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310%20USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=356&sh=356%202x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991.98px)\" /><source srcset=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310%20USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=390&sh=241, https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310%20USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=390&sh=241%202x\" media=\"(min-width: 576px) and (max-width: 767.98px)\" /><source srcset=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310%20USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=390&sh=241, https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310%20USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=390&sh=241%202x\" media=\"(max-width: 575px)\" /><img src=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw8b927242/pdp/JBL_Tune_310%20USBC_LifestyleImage_White_2.png?sw=904&sh=560\" alt=\"JBL Tune 310C USB Compatible with USB-C devices - Image\" /></picture>\n\n<div class=\"feature-text\">\n\n<h3>Compatible with USB-C devices</h3>\n\nNeed to connect to a PC, mobile or gaming device? USB-C connectivity ensures compatibility with a wide range of devices*. *Please check USB-C compatibility with your device.\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lifestyle-feature\"><picture class=\"carousel-images-container\"><source srcset=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black 3.png?sw=1356&sh=840, https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black 3.png?sw=2034&sh=1260 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px)\" /><source srcset=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black 3.png?sw=904&sh=560, https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black 3.png?sw=1356&sh=840 2x \" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199.98px)\" /><source srcset=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black 3.png?sw=904&sh=560, https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black%203.png?sw=356&sh=356%202x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991.98px)\" /><source srcset=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black%203.png?sw=390&sh=241, https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black%203.png?sw=390&sh=241%202x\" media=\"(min-width: 576px) and (max-width: 767.98px)\" /><source srcset=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black%203.png?sw=390&sh=241, https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black%203.png?sw=390&sh=241%202x\" media=\"(max-width: 575px)\" /><img src=\"https://www.jbl.com/dw/image/v2/BFND_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman/default/dw4449c866/pdp/JBL_Tune_310C_LifestyleImage_Black%203.png?sw=904&sh=560\" alt=\"JBL Tune 310C USB 3-button remote with microphone - Image\" /></picture></div>",
