    "shortDesc": "1. Big metal mesh surface, with two silent fan diameter 14 cm with Blue LED Lights.\n\n2. Special air flow outlet design,keeping your notebook cool during use.\n\n3. Can be worked on desk or on bed Slim, light weight, allowing you to store it in your laptop Bag and take it with you whenever you go.\n\n4. Two USB ports for Laptop Cooling Pad can connect more USB devices. One is connected to the laptop for power supply. The other connects additional USB devices, such as USB flash drives, keyboards, etc.\n\n5. Fashion and unique design,comfortable feeling,hold you and your notebook in an safe and comfortable situation.\n\n6. Packing list: cooing pad x 1, USB power cable x 1",
    "description": "1. Dual Fan Cooling: Equipped with two 14cm large fans, large air volume, low noise, and the fan adopts LED light design\n\n2. Adjustable Speed: Features 7 levels of speed adjustment, allowing you to customize cooling performance to your needs. Effectively cool the laptop and extend the life of the laptop\n\n3. Ergonomic Design: It can stably support your laptop, and the adjustable height design provides the best viewing angle and typing comfort\n\n4. Quiet Operation: Designed for silent operation, ensuring a noise-free environment while you work or study\n\n5. Compact and Portable: With its slim profile and lightweight design, this cooling pad is easy to carry and store\n\n\n\nSpecifications:\n\n1. Model: X3\n\n2. Voltage: 5V\n\n3. Current: 0.32A\n\n4. Power: 3.2W\n\n5. Number of fans: 2\n\n6. Fan Size: 14cm (2 pcs)\n\n7. Fan Speed: 1300 +/- 10% rpm\n\n8. Product Dimensions: 35.6 x 25.9 x 2.8 cm\n\n9. Product Weight: 0.71 kg",
