    "shortDesc": "<ul class=\"\">\n\n \t<li data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp.product_detail.i0.290dpO4WpO4WMT\">100% Brand new and quality Products</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp.product_detail.i0.290dpO4WpO4WMT\">High-resolution full HD quality 1920×1080 pixels</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp.product_detail.i1.290dpO4WpO4WMT\">3.5 mm jack socket for transferring sound/audio</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp.product_detail.i2.290dpO4WpO4WMT\">Ideal for connecting a PC\notebook/tablet PC with HDMI™ output to a VGA monitor/TV or projector</li>\n\n</ul>",
    "description": "<h1>HDMI to VGA Converter with Audio Output</h1>\n\nBuy HDMI to VGA Converter with Audio Output in Sri Lanka. Looking for a way to connect your HDMI device to a VGA display with audio? This HDMI to VGA adapter helps you to connect HDMI Devices to VGA Displays.\n\n\n\n* Please note This Converter Works only one way which means HDMI Devices to VGA Display\n\n<h4>HDMI to Vga with 3.5 mm Audio, HDMI to VGA Adapter (Male to Female) for Computer. Desktop, Laptop, PC, Monitor, Projector, Full HDTV, Media Players, Xbox [NOT for VGA to HDMI]</h4>\n\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">The compact-designed portable HDMI to VGA adapter connects a computer, desktop, laptop, or other devices with an HDMI port to a monitor, projector, HDTV, or other devices with a VGA port</span></li>\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Built-in advanced – Certified AG6200 IC chip converts HDMI digital signal to VGA analog signal. It is NOT a bi-directional converter and cannot transmit signals from VGA to HDMI</span></li>\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">The HDMI male-to-VGA female converter supports resolutions up to 1920×1080@60Hz (1080p Full HD) including 720p, 1600×1200, and 1280×1024 for high-definition monitors or projectors. Gold-plated HDMI connector resists corrosion and abrasion and improves the signal transmission performance; Molded strain relief increases cable durability</span></li>\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">The HDMI-VGA adapter is compatible with computers, pc, desktops, laptops, ultrabooks, notebooks, Chromebook, Raspberry Pi, Intel Nuc, Roku, PS3, Xbox One, Xbox 360, Wii U, Set Top Box, TV BOX, or other devices with HDMI port. NOT compatible with Blu-ray players and devices with low-power HDMI ports such as SONY PS4, Apple MacBook Pro with Retina Display, Mac mini, and Apple TV</span></li>\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">COMPATIBLE with computer, pc, desktop, laptop, or other devices with <a href=\"https://ido.lk/product/premium-quality-4k-hdmi-cable-v2-0/\">HDMI</a> port</span></li>\n\n \t<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Comes with 6 Month’s Warranty.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p align=\"left\">This is a new Chip adapter that can convert the HDMI digital signal to VGA analog signal. It has a built-in chip, so can convert the signal from digital to analog. Enable PC, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DVD\">DVD</a>, and other HDMI male input devices to be connected up to a computer monitor, projector, or other display. It supports the high-definition output of 720P or 1080P.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 align=\"left\">HDMI to VGA Converter with Audio Output Specifications:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Input Signal: HDMI Digital signal;</li>\n\n \t<li>Output Signal: VGA analog signal;</li>\n\n \t<li>Resolution:480p/720p/1080i/1080p(automatic);</li>\n\n \t<li>Support: Accord with HDMI 1.3/1.4 Agreement;</li>\n\n \t<li>Weight: about 40-50g</li>\n\n \t<li>Color: Black/white (optional)</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<strong>Product C Package List:</strong>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>1 x HDMI to VGA Cable(With audio port)</li>\n\n \t<li>1 x 3.5mm Audio Cable</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n \n\n\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter entered lazyloaded\" src=\"https://ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/ee6a09d78495c639d5c595a45e66eb3a.jpg\" alt=\"HDMI to VGA Converter with Audio Output: Buy Online at Best  Prices in Sri Lanka | ido.lk\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" data-lazy-src=\"https://ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/ee6a09d78495c639d5c595a45e66eb3a.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" /><img class=\"aligncenter entered lazyloaded\" src=\"https://ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/414HOnfVHLL.jpg\" alt=\"HDMI to VGA Converter with Audio Output: Buy Online at Best  Prices in Sri Lanka | ido.lk\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" data-lazy-src=\"https://ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/414HOnfVHLL.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" /><img class=\"aligncenter entered lazyloaded\" src=\"https://ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/61wx1Bdp32L._SL1000.jpg\" alt=\"HDMI to VGA Converter with Audio Output: Buy Online at Best  Prices in Sri Lanka | ido.lk\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" data-lazy-src=\"https://ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/61wx1Bdp32L._SL1000.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" /><img class=\"aligncenter entered lazyloaded\" src=\"https://ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/71KyiofFg3L._SL1200.jpg\" alt=\"HDMI to VGA Converter with Audio Output: Buy Online at Best  Prices in Sri Lanka | ido.lk\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" data-lazy-src=\"https://ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/71KyiofFg3L._SL1200.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" /><img class=\"aligncenter entered lazyloaded\" src=\"https://ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/614eWc8sLIL._SL1000.jpg\" alt=\"HDMI to VGA Converter with Audio Output: Buy Online at Best  Prices in Sri Lanka | ido.lk\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" data-lazy-src=\"https://ido.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/614eWc8sLIL._SL1000.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" />",
