    "shortDesc": "• Model: Aspor A319<br data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"269\" />• Capacity: 50000mAh (Rated 40000mAh)<br data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"309\" />• Fast Charging: 22.5W Power Delivery<br data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"349\" />• Built-in Cables: Lightning, USB, USB-C (5V=2.4A)<br data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"402\" />• Ports: 3 inputs, 5 outputs<br data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"433\" />• Display: LED battery indicator<br data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"468\" />• Features: High capacity, multiple device charging, durable design, portable<br data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"548\" />• Suitable for: Smartphones, tablets, and other electronic devices\n\n<h4>6 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<p data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"218\"><strong data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"216\">Aspor A319 Power Bank – 50000mAh with 22.5W Fast Charging & 3 Built-in Cables</strong></p>\n\n<p data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"484\">Power all your devices effortlessly with the <strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"299\">Aspor A319 50000mAh Power Bank</strong>, designed for ultimate performance and convenience. With multiple inputs and outputs, fast charging, and integrated cables, this high-capacity power bank keeps you connected all day.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"530\">Key Features of Aspor A319 Power Bank:</h3>\n\n<ul data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"1183\">\n\n \t<li data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"690\">\n\n<p data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"690\"><strong data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"581\">Gigantic 50000mAh Capacity (Rated 40000mAh):</strong> Provides multiple full charges for smartphones, tablets, and gadgets — perfect for heavy users and travel.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"789\">\n\n<p data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"789\"><strong data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"717\">22.5W Fast Charging:</strong> Supports quick power delivery to your devices for efficient charging.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"899\">\n\n<p data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"899\"><strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"814\">3 Built-in Cables:</strong> Lightning, USB, and USB-C cables included for convenience — no extra wires needed.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"995\">\n\n<p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"995\"><strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"921\">Multiple Ports:</strong> 3 inputs and 5 outputs allow simultaneous charging of multiple devices.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1072\">\n\n<p data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1072\"><strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1014\">LED Display:</strong> Shows remaining battery percentage for easy monitoring.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1183\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1183\"><strong data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1109\">Durable & High-Quality Design:</strong> Aspor’s unique design ensures reliability and long-lasting performance.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n</ul>",
