    "description": "<ul>\n\n \t<li data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i4.67701520DtLVKq\">\n\n<div>New Bluetooth Headphones Wireless Foldable Stereo Headphone with Microphone</div></li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<div>Bluetooth High Speed Connected, Answering Incoming Calls, Handsfree Talking, Superior Combability, High Fidelity Stereo Surround Sound</div></li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<div>Built-in microphone technology allows clear Phone communication; Enables use as a headset. Music and phone controls ensure ease of use</div></li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<div>Support TF card and FM radio.</div></li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<div>True Wireless Communication :Enjoy the freedom of movement with no wires to hold you back. The earphones connect wirelessly to your device for a seamless audio experience.</div></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<div>Active Noise-Cancellation :Block out unwanted noise and distractions for a more immersive listening experience. The earphones feature active noise-cancellation technology to keep you focused on your music.</div></li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<div>Touch Control :Easily manage your music and calls with simple touch gestures. The earbuds come with a charging bin that doubles as a touch control center, making it easy to manage your music and calls without having to take out your phone.</div></li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<div data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i0.67701520DtLVKq\">Volume Control :Adjust the volume of your music or calls directly from the earbuds. No need to reach for your phone or other devices. The earbuds feature built-in volume control, making it easy to adjust the volume of your music or calls without interrupting your flow.</div></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/lk/p/e6d522039678e2c3d49e95210d2e7d01.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /> <img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/lk/p/72ba744040ee8e4608e6d5e543dd98f7.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /> <img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/lk/p/594c2b4f333a2bbe57a9cef21169a104.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /> <img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/lk/p/1afd72360cda504a5db69cc571148ac5.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" />",
