    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Silences Noise in Real Time</li>\n\n \t<li>Electrifying, Crisp Highs</li>\n\n \t<li>Immersive Dolby Audio</li>\n\n \t<li>IP55 Water and Dust-Resistant</li>\n\n \t<li>Crystal-Clear Calls</li>\n\n \t<li>Thunderous Bass</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<strong>6 Months Warranty</strong>",
    "description": "<h2 data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"697\">Anker Soundcore Liberty 5 ANC Earbuds – Silence the Noise, Feel the Sound</h2>\n\n<p data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"1110\">The <strong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"744\">Anker Soundcore Liberty 5 ANC Earbuds</strong> are engineered for music lovers, commuters, and professionals who demand <strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"898\">premium sound quality, adaptive noise cancellation, and long-lasting comfort</strong>. Whether you’re <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"945\">traveling on a noisy train</strong>, <strong data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"982\">taking important business calls</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1035\">immersing yourself in your favorite playlist.</strong> These earbuds deliver <strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1107\">crystal-clear audio and superior performance</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1137\">Key Features</h3>\n\n<ul data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"2053\">\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1273\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1273\"><strong data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1172\">2x Stronger Voice Reduction</strong>: Powered by Adaptive ANC 3.0 and a custom acoustic cavity for unmatched background noise control.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1402\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1402\"><strong data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1306\">Real-Time Adaptive ANC 3.0:</strong> Adjusts every 0.3 seconds to create a quiet listening environment, no matter where you are.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1542\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1542\"><strong data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1430\">Immersive Dolby Audio:</strong> Enjoy a theater-like sound experience with spatial clarity that places you at the heart of the performance.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1711\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1711\"><strong data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1566\">Detail-Rich Sound:</strong> Wool-paper diaphragms and bass tubes deliver deep bass and crisp highs. Supports <strong data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1658\">LDAC</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1679\">Hi-Res Audio</strong> for audiophile-grade quality.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1872\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1872\"><strong data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1737\">Crystal-Clear Calls:</strong> 6 microphones combined with AI noise reduction and wind-resistance technology ensure natural, professional-sounding conversations.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"2053\">\n\n<p data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"2053\"><strong data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1900\">Powerful Battery Life:</strong> Up to <strong data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1957\">12 hours of playback (48H with case) on ANC off</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2001\">8 hours (32H with case) with ANC on</strong>. A quick 10-minute charge provides 5 extra hours.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2118\">Why Choose Anker Soundcore Liberty 5 ANC Earbuds?</h3>\n\n<p data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2474\">Unlike standard wireless earbuds, the <strong data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2175\">Liberty 5 ANC</strong> combines <strong data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2218\">cutting-edge Adaptive ANC 3.0</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2235\">Dolby Audio</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2270\">LDAC Hi-Res certification</strong> to deliver a studio-quality sound experience. With a sleek design, AI-powered call clarity, and all-day comfort, they’re perfect for <strong data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2471\">music enthusiasts, frequent travelers, and hybrid professionals</strong>.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2474\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-33551\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Anker-Soundcore-Liberty-5-earbud-300x300.webp\" alt=\"Anker Soundcore Liberty 5 ANC Earbuds Dolby Audio Black Sri Lanka\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-33547\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Anker-Soundcore-Liberty-5-ANC-Ea-300x300.png\" alt=\"Anker Soundcore Liberty 5 ANC Earbuds Dolby Audio Black Sri Lanka\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-33550\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Anker-Soundcore-Liberty-5-earbud-1-300x300.webp\" alt=\"Anker Soundcore Liberty 5 ANC Earbuds Dolby Audio Black Sri Lanka\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></p>",
