    "description": "<h2>MEETION BTM185 2.4G Wireless + Bluetooth Silent Mouse – Quiet Control, Smart Connectivity</h2>\n\nHarness the power of dual-mode connection with the <strong>MEETION BTM185 2.4G Wireless + Bluetooth Silent Mouse</strong>, crafted to deliver seamless performance, whisper-quiet clicks, and versatile compatibility. Whether working late nights or switching between devices, this <strong>Meetion wireless & silent mouse</strong> keeps you connected, focused, and distraction-free.\n\n\n\nDesigned for flexibility and convenience, the <strong>MEETION BTM185 Bluetooth Silent Mouse</strong> supports both 2.4GHz wireless and Bluetooth 5.1, enabling you to pair with up to three devices and switch among them effortlessly. Its silent key design, adjustable DPI (800–3200), and ergonomic profile make it a reliable companion for work, study, or everyday use.\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Dual-Mode Connectivity (2.4G + Bluetooth 5.1)</strong> – Connect and switch between three devices with one mouse.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Silent Click Technology</strong> – Reduce noise while clicking, ideal for office or shared spaces.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Adjustable DPI (800 – 3200)</strong> – Tailor sensitivity for browsing, editing, or gaming tasks.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Long Battery Life & Smart Sleep Mode</strong> – Up to 220 hours of active use; enters sleep mode after inactivity.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Ergonomic & Compact Design</strong> – Comfortable grip and lightweight build for everyday use.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Plug & Play Support</strong> – No drivers required; compatible with Windows and macOS.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Model: BTM185</li>\n\n \t<li>Wireless Modes: 2.4GHz + Bluetooth 5.1 dual-mode</li>\n\n \t<li>Device Switching: Up to 3 devices</li>\n\n \t<li>DPI Range: 800 / 1200 / 1600 / 2400 / 3200</li>\n\n \t<li>Silent Switch: Left/right click ~3 million cycles</li>\n\n \t<li>Battery Type: Single AA battery</li>\n\n \t<li>Operating Time: Up to ~220 hours (active mode)</li>\n\n \t<li>Range: Up to 10 meters</li>\n\n \t<li>Size: 106.8 × 68.8 × 39.5 mm</li>\n\n \t<li>Weight: Approx 66 g ±2 g</li>\n\n \t<li>Compatibility: Windows, macOS (plug & play)</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<strong>Package Includes</strong>\n\n1 × MEETION BTM185 Wireless + Bluetooth Silent Mouse\n\n1 × USB Nano Receiver\n\n1 × User Manual\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-33622\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/png80-t3-scale100-2-300x300.png\" alt=\"Meetion BTM185 2.4G Wireless and Bluetooth Silent Mouse Black Sri Lanka\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-33623\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/png80-t3-scale100-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"Meetion BTM185 2.4G Wireless and Bluetooth Silent Mouse Black Sri Lanka\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-33621\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/png80-t3-scale100-3-300x300.png\" alt=\"Meetion BTM185 2.4G Wireless and Bluetooth Silent Mouse Black Sri Lanka\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-33620\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/png80-t3-scale100-4-300x300.png\" alt=\"Meetion BTM185 2.4G Wireless and Bluetooth Silent Mouse Black Sri Lanka\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />",
    "warrantyPeriod": "1 Year Warranty",
