    "shortDesc": "<ul class=\"\">\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Active Noise Cancellation (ANC):</b> Advanced technology that identifies and neutralizes external noise, allowing you to immerse yourself fully in your music or calls.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hi-Fi Stereo Sound:</b> Large dynamic drivers deliver crisp highs and deep, punching bass for a professional-grade audio experience.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Smart Touch Controls:</b> Effortlessly switch between ANC modes, control music playback, and answer calls with high-sensitivity touch sensors.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Extended Playtime:</b> Enjoy hours of continuous listening on a single charge, with the compact charging case providing multiple additional charges.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bluetooth 5.3 Technology:</b> Ensures a faster, more stable connection with lower power consumption and minimal latency for videos and gaming.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li>\n\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ergonomic Secure Fit:</b> Lightweight design with soft silicone tips ensures the earbuds stay comfortable and secure during workouts or daily commutes.</p>\n\n</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>3 Months Warranty</h4>",
