    "description": "The <strong>VGR V-975 Professional Salon Series Hair Trimmer</strong> is the perfect grooming tool for men and boys, offering precision and convenience in one sleek design. Available in stylish Green/Black and Gold/Black colors, this trimmer features a powerful T-blade for accurate cuts and a runtime of 120 minutes after just 2 hours of charging. Its LED display keeps you informed about battery status and oiling needs, while the USB charging option ensures portability and ease of use. With 4 length adjustment guide combs (1mm, 2mm, 3mm, 4mm) and a magnetic protection cap for easy cleaning, this trimmer delivers professional results at home or on the go. Lightweight and compact, it’s perfect for personal or professional grooming.\n\n\n\n<b>Maintenance and Care Guidelines:</b>\n\n\n\nFor the longer  life of the appliance there are few points to keep in mind. Below are the few do’s and don’ts for a proper care of this men’s Clipper:\n\n<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>Do's</strong></p>\n\n• Use the provided guide combs to adjust trimming length.\n\n\n\n• Clean the blade and body with the provided brush after each use.\n\n\n\n• Charge the trimmer with the included USB cable (5V-1A adapter).\n\n\n\n<strong>Don'ts</strong>\n\n\n\n• Don’t immerse the trimmer in water or rinse under the tap.\n\n\n\n• Don’t use the device on animals.\n\n\n\n• Don’t charge with incompatible adapters or sources.\n\n\n\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-33879 size-full\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/vgr-v975-trimmer-with-accessorie.webp\" alt=\"VGR V-975 Professional Salon Series Hair Trimmer for Men and Boys Sri Lanka\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" />",
