    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>20W Power Delivery</li>\n\n \t<li>Power Delivery 3.0 Fast Charging</li>\n\n \t<li>Quick Charge 4.0, 3.0, and 2.0 Compatible</li>\n\n \t<li>Safe and Reliable Charging with Multi-Protection</li>\n\n \t<li>Compact and Portable, Ideal for Travel</li>\n\n \t<li>Model no: CD137</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>1 Year Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">The </span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">UGREEN 20W Type-C PD Fast Charging Adapter UK (White) – CD137</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> is a high-performance charging solution designed for fast and efficient power delivery. With support for Power Delivery 3.0 and Quick Charge 4.0, 3.0, and 2.0, this charger provides safe and reliable charging for your devices. Its compact and travel-friendly design ensures convenience, making it an excellent choice for home, office, or on-the-go use.</span>\n\n<h3><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Key Features : </span></strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Power Delivery 3.0 Fast Charging</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">:</span>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Provides </span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">20W of output</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> via the USB-C port, enabling fast charging for compatible devices, such as iPhones and Android smartphones.</span></li>\n\n \t<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Capable of charging an iPhone 13 from 0% to 50% in approximately 30 minutes.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Quick Charge Compatibility</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">:</span>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Supports </span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Quick Charge 4.0, 3.0, and 2.0</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">, offering rapid and efficient charging for QC-compatible devices.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Safe and Reliable Charging</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">:</span>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Equipped with </span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">multi-protection features</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">, including protection against over-voltage, over-current, overheating, and short circuits, ensuring safe and dependable charging.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Compact and Portable Design</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">:</span>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Lightweight and </span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">travel-friendly</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">, ideal for carrying in your bag or pocket for convenient charging anytime, anywhere.</span></li>\n\n \t<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">UK plug compatibility ensures it works seamlessly with British outlets.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n</ol>\n\n<h3><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Specifications</span></strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Brand</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">: UGREEN</span></li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Model</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">: CD137 – 60451</span></li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Power Supply (Input)</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">: AC 100-240V / 50-60Hz</span></li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Power Supply (Output)</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">:</span>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">USB-C: DC 5V/3A, 9V/2.22A, 12V/1.67A (20W Max)</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Supported Charging Protocols</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">:</span>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">PD 3.0</span></strong></li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Quick Charge 4.0, 3.0, 2.0</span></strong></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Material</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">: Fireproof PC</span></li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Color</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">: White</span></li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Dimensions</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">: Compact and lightweight for portability.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Applications</span></strong></h3>\n\n<ol>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Smartphones and Tablets</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">:</span>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Compatible Android and iPhone devices, Type-C PD or QC-enabled devices.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Accessories</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">:</span>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Charges smaller devices like wireless earbuds, smartwatches, and portable power banks efficiently.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Travel and Everyday Use</span></strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">:</span>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Perfect for use at home, in the office, or while traveling, thanks to its compact and lightweight design.</span></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n</ol>",
