    "description": "<h1>UGREEN Nexode 20000mAh 130W Smart Display Power Bank – PB721</h1>\n\n<strong>UGREEN Nexode 20000mAh 130W Smart Display Power Bank (PB721) is a high-performance portable charger designed for professionals, travelers, and tech enthusiasts who require fast, reliable power on the go. Here’s an overview of its key features:</strong>\n\n<h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Battery Capacity</strong>: 20,000mAh (72Wh), offering approximately 4 full charges for an iPhone 15, 2 charges for an iPad Pro 11″, or 1.3 charges for a MacBook Air 13″.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Total Output Power</strong>: Up to 130W across three ports:\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>USB-C1: 100W Max</li>\n\n \t<li>USB-C2: 30W Max</li>\n\n \t<li>USB-A: 22.5W Max</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Fast Charging</strong>: Capable of charging a MacBook Pro 16″ to 43% and an iPhone 15 to 60% simultaneously in just 30 minutes.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Smart TFT Display</strong>: Provides real-time information on battery level, voltage, current, and per-port charging power.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Compact Design</strong>: Measuring 131×54×50.8 mm and weighing 480g, it’s portable and easy to carry.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Wide Compatibility</strong>: Supports various charging protocols, including PD3.0, PD2.0, PPS, SCP, QC3.0, QC2.0, FCP, AFC, and Apple 5V2.4A, making it compatible with a wide range of devices.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2><strong>Package Contents</strong></h2>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>UGREEN Nexode 20000mAh 130W Power Bank (PB721)</li>\n\n \t<li>USB-C Charging Cable</li>\n\n \t<li>User Manual</li>\n\n</ul>\n\nThis power bank is ideal for users seeking a versatile and powerful charging solution that supports both high-capacity and fast charging needs. Its smart display and compact design make it a convenient companion for travel and daily use.",
