    "image": "/products/images/7c0c1629a4.webp",
    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>For Commutes, Travel, Gaming & Home TV</li>\n\n \t<li>ULT Button Boosts Bass</li>\n\n \t<li>40mm Drivers with Neodymium Magnets</li>\n\n \t<li>Dual-Sensor Noise Canceling</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>1 Year Manufacturer Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<h2>Sony WH-ULT900N ULT Wireless Over-Ear Noise Canceling Headphones</h2>\n\n<h3><strong>Feel the Beat with Enhanced Bass</strong></h3>\n\nDive into two powerful bass modes: <strong>ULT1</strong> for a deep, resonating experience and <strong>ULT2</strong> for dynamic, punchy beats. Powered by a 40mm driver and Integrated Processor V1, every sound comes alive with precision.\n\n<h4><strong>Rediscover Authentic Sound</strong></h4>\n\nSony’s <strong>Digital Sound Enhancement Engine (DSEE)</strong> restores the richness and clarity of compressed tracks, delivering sound that feels closer to the original recording. Enjoy every high-frequency detail as the artist intended.\n\n<h4><strong>Customize Your Listening Experience</strong></h4>\n\nFine-tune your sound using the <strong>Sony Headphones Connect app.</strong> Choose from various presets tailored to music genres or craft your own equalizer settings to match your unique taste.\n\n<h4><strong>Block Out the World</strong></h4>\n\nDual microphones in each earcup and <strong>Dual Noise Sensor technology</strong> effectively cancel ambient noise. Whether in a bustling café or on a windy day, enjoy uninterrupted audio clarity.\n\n<h4><strong>Intelligent Adaptive Sound Control</strong></h4>\n\n<strong>Smart sensing technology</strong> adjusts sound modes based on your activity and location. Whether you’re at the gym or commuting, your headphones optimize ambient sound for a perfect listening experience.\n\n<h4><strong>Sony WH-ULT900N Comfort Meets Sophistication</strong></h4>\n\nWith a stylish design and thermo-foam cushions, the ULT WEAR headphones provide all-day comfort. The <strong>balanced clamping force</strong> ensures snug wear, while the swivel-fold design adds portability for life on the go.\n\n<h4><strong>Unstoppable Battery Life</strong></h4>\n\nStay powered with up to <strong>30 hours of playback</strong> on a full charge. Quick charging provides <strong>90 minutes of music in just 3 minutes</strong> or <strong>5 hours in 10 minutes.</strong> Turn off noise canceling to extend battery life to an incredible <strong>50 hours.</strong>\n\n<h4><strong>Sony WH-ULT900N Pause and Play Instantly</strong></h4>\n\nSmart sensors detect when you remove the headphones, automatically pausing your music. Place them back on, and your tunes resume seamlessly.\n\n<h4><strong>Effortless Touch Controls</strong></h4>\n\nNavigate tracks, adjust volume, or take calls with a simple swipe or tap on the headphone panel. Need to focus? <strong>Quick Attention Mode</strong> lowers the volume instantly, letting ambient sounds in.\n\n<h4><strong>Sony WH-ULT900N Seamless Bluetooth Pairing</strong></h4>\n\nPairing is hassle-free with <strong>Fast Pair for Android</strong> and <strong>Swift Pair for Windows.</strong> One tap connects your headphones to your devices, ensuring you’re always ready to listen.\n\n\n\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-34233 size-full\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/download-2026-04-06T191508.803.webp\" alt=\"Sony WH-ULT900N ULT WEAR Wireless Noise Canceling Headphones Sri Lanka\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" /> <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-34232 size-full\" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/download-2026-04-06T190945.353.webp\" alt=\"Sony WH-ULT900N ULT WEAR Wireless Noise Canceling Headphones Sri Lanka\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" />\n\n\n\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-34227 \" src=\"https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/download-2026-04-06T191242.778.webp\" alt=\"Sony WH-ULT900N ULT WEAR Wireless Noise Canceling Headphones Sri Lanka\" width=\"672\" height=\"672\" />",
