    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Up to 50-hour battery life</li>\n\n \t<li>Quick charging</li>\n\n \t<li>Crystal clear hands-free calling with built-in mic</li>\n\n \t<li>Multipoint connection</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>1 Year Manufacturer Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<h2>Sony WH-CH520 Wireless On-Ear Headphones with Microphone</h2>\n\n<h3><strong>Customized Audio for Every Genre</strong></h3>\n\nThe WH-CH520 headphones offer unmatched versatility with the EQ Custom feature in the Sony | Headphones Connect App. With a variety of presets tailored to different music genres, you can enjoy sound quality optimized for every playlist. Prefer your own unique sound? Create and save custom presets to match your personal taste.\n\n<h4><strong>All-Day Comfort with a Lightweight Design</strong></h4>\n\nEngineered for extended listening sessions, these headphones are lightweight and equipped with soft earpads and an additional head cushion. Silent joints enhance the design, ensuring a distraction-free fit. Whether you’re binge-listening to podcasts or your favorite album, the WH-CH520 keeps comfort a top priority.\n\n<h4><strong>Sony WH-CH520 Wireless On-Ear Headphones Effortless Hands-Free Calling</strong></h4>\n\nStay connected with hands-free calling that lets conversations flow smoothly. A built-in microphone ensures clear communication, and there’s no need to reach for your phone—enjoy the convenience of taking calls directly through your headphones.\n\n<h4><strong>Seamless Multipoint Connection</strong></h4>\n\nThe Sony WH-CH520 Wireless On-Ear Headphones makes multitasking simple with its multipoint Bluetooth connection. Pair the headphones with two devices simultaneously, allowing you to switch effortlessly from a laptop video to a phone call. You’ll never miss a moment, whether at work or on the go.\n\n<h4><strong>Voice Assistant Integration at Your Command</strong></h4>\n\nActivate your favorite virtual assistant with a simple voice command. Whether you use “OK Google” or “Hey Siri,” accessing your digital assistant is quick and seamless, adding convenience to your daily routine.\n\n<h4><strong>Find Your Headphones with Fast Pair</strong></h4>\n\nFast Pair integration with Google makes locating your headphones a breeze. Use the Find My Device app to play a sound on your WH-CH520 or track their last known location. Say goodbye to the frustration of misplaced headphones!\n\n<h4><strong>Sony WH-CH520 Wireless On-Ear Headphones Perfect Blend of Style and Functionality</strong></h4>\n\nBeyond their technical prowess, the WH-CH520 headphones are designed with sleek aesthetics and user-friendly features. From customizable sound to effortless connectivity, they’re the ideal choice for anyone seeking high-quality audio on the move.\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://sony.scene7.com/is/image/sonyglobalsolutions/WH-CH520_White_Sound_M?$largeImageMobile$&fmt=png-alpha\" srcset=\"https://sony.scene7.com/is/image/sonyglobalsolutions/WH-CH520_White_Sound_M?$largeImageMobile$&fmt=png-alpha, https://sony.scene7.com/is/image/sonyglobalsolutions/WH-CH520_White_Sound_M?$largeImageMobile$&fmt=png-alpha\" alt=\"Person wearing a pair of pink Sony WH-CH520 headphones, relaxing in a cosy room.\" />\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://sony.scene7.com/is/image/sonyglobalsolutions/WH-CH520_Blue_Call_Medium_mobile?$mediumstaticimagehotspot$\" alt=\"Image of a man sitting on a wall wearing Sony WH-CH520 headphones and holding a mobile phone with a skateboard in the foreground\" />\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://sony.scene7.com/is/image/sonyglobalsolutions/WH-CH520_Black_Multipoint_Medium_mobile?$mediumstaticimagehotspot$\" alt=\"Image of a man sitting on some steps wearing Sony WH-CH520 headphones whilst using a laptop and mobile phone\" />",
