    "shortDesc": "<div class=\"specification-block\">\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Product name : HAYLOU HQ5 True Wireless Noise Cancellation Earphones</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Wireless connection : Bluetooth V6.0</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Bluetooth protocol : A2DP, AVRCP, HFP</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Audio codec : SBC, AAC</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Product colour : Black, white</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Product dimensions : 35*21.1*23.1mm</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Product weight : 4g per earbud (total: about 80g)</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Communication range : ≥10 meters (open environment without obstacles)</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Charging case battery capacity : 320mAh</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Earbud battery capacity : 30mAh</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Charging time of earbuds : About 2 hours</li>\n\n \t<li>When ANC mode is off, playtime is more than 5 hours (50% volume)</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Charging port : Type-C</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Standby time : About 180 days</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Waterproof rating : IPX4</li>\n\n \t<li class=\"spec-txt-20-30\">Compatible system : iOS 9.0+ / Android 4.4+</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>6 Months Warranty</h4>\n\n</div>",
    "description": "<h5>Adaptive ANC</h5>\n\nDual-ear feed-forward ANC reduces ambient noise by up to-28dB across different frequency ranges. In-ear design and silicone ear tios further isolate noises for immersive listening\n\n<h5>Latest Bluetooth 6.0 Chip</h5>\n\nPowered by the latest Bluetooth 6.0 chip, HAYLOU HQS ensures a faster, more stable connection with lawer latency and power consumption.\n\n<h5>Double-layer Ear Tips</h5>\n\nHAYLOU HOS comes equipped with skin-friendly silicone ear tips featuring a built-in dust-proof mesh that effectively prevents dust from entering the sound cavity, ensuring hygiene during use and extended durability\n\n<h5>High-performance Drivers</h5>\n\nHAYLOU HQS features 10mm dynamic drivers, fine-tuned to deliver strong bass, clear mids, and bright treble ensuring studio-grade clarity with every note.\n\n<h5>4-mic ENC for Calls</h5>\n\nFour nigh-sensitivity mics and an ENC algorithm filter ambient noise, ensuring your voice is heard clearly in a noisy environment.\n\n\n\n4 mics Accurately pick up hnuman voice &\n\nENC algorithm suppresses ambient noise during calls\n\n<h5>One-tap Reset</h5>\n\nEasily solve issues like re-pairing and disconnection of a single earbud in just 5 seconds through the reset button on the charging case.\n\n<h5>Ultra-low Latency Mode</h5>\n\nHAYLOU HQS delivers ultra-low latency with audio-visual sync that ennances spatial awareness for footsteps and enemy positions, allowing you to always act before the enemy\n\n\n\n*When Gaming Mode is enabled, connection stability may slightly docrease. For non-gaming sconaries disable Gaming Mode for optimal music experience.",
