    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>5.1ch surround sound with subwooferDolby Atmos & DTS:X cinematic audio</li>\n\n \t<li>Dedicated center speaker for clear dialogue</li>\n\n \t<li>BRAVIA TV pairing with Voice Zoom 3</li>\n\n \t<li>Bluetooth & BRAVIA Connect App control</li>\n\n \t<li>Multi Stereo mode for room-filling sound</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>18 Months Manufacturer Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<div class=\"Description_reviews_wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"ProductDescription_container\">\n\n<h2 class=\"ProductDescription_catchCopy\">5.1ch cinematic power—feel it move with Dolby Atmos®</h2>\n\n<p class=\"ProductDescription_bodyCopy\">Turn up the energy with 5.1ch surround sound in minutes with easy setup. Powered by Dolby Atmos® and DTS:X®, this all-in-one system—soundbar, subwoofer, and wireless rear speakers—delivers sound that dances around you.</p>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"Reviews_icon_wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"ReviewsAndShare_container\">\n\n<div class=\"CustomerReviews_container\">\n\n<div id=\"rating_summary\" class=\"ECInlineRating_Container\" data-bv-show=\"rating_summary\" data-bv-seo=\"true\" data-bv-product-id=\"ht-s60\" data-bv-ready=\"true\">\n\n<div class=\"bv_main_container\">\n\n<div class=\"bv_rating_summary_buttons_container\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"Share_Retailer_wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"RetailerLinks_container\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"FunctionLogos_awards_wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"FunctionalLogos_container\">\n\n<div class=\"FunctionalLogos_wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"FunctionalLogo\"><img class=\"FunctionalLogo_image\" src=\"https://www.sony.com.my/content/dam/sony/contents/global/televisionsandhometheatre/home-theatre-sound-bars/year-2025/common/product-summary/HAVFY25_C_Dolby_Atoms_logo.png\" alt=\"Logo of Dolby Atmos\" /><img class=\"FunctionalLogo_image\" src=\"https://www.sony.com.my/content/dam/sony/contents/global/televisionsandhometheatre/home-theatre-sound-bars/year-2025/common/product-summary/HAVFY25_C_dtsX_logo.png\" alt=\"Logo of DTS:X\" /><img class=\"FunctionalLogo_image\" src=\"https://www.sony.com.my/content/dam/sony/contents/global/televisionsandhometheatre/home-theatre-sound-bars/year-2025/common/product-summary/HAVFY25_C_HDMI_logo.png\" alt=\"Logo of HDMI\" /><img class=\"FunctionalLogo_image\" src=\"https://www.sony.com.my/content/dam/sony/contents/global/televisionsandhometheatre/home-theatre-sound-bars/year-2025/common/product-summary/HAVFY24_C_Bluetooth_logo.png\" alt=\"Logo of Bluetooth\" /><img class=\"FunctionalLogo_image\" src=\"https://www.sony.com.my/content/dam/sony/contents/global/televisionsandhometheatre/home-theatre-sound-bars/year-2025/common/product-summary/HAVFY24_C_Vertical_Surround_Engine_logo.png\" alt=\"Logo of S-Force Pro Front Surround\" /><img class=\"FunctionalLogo_image\" src=\"https://www.sony.com.my/content/dam/sony/contents/global/televisionsandhometheatre/home-theatre-sound-bars/year-2025/common/product-summary/Vertical_Surround_Engine_new.png\" alt=\"Logo of Vertical Surround Engine\" /><img class=\"FunctionalLogo_image\" src=\"https://www.sony.com.my/content/dam/sony/contents/global/televisionsandhometheatre/home-theatre-sound-bars/year-2025/common/product-summary/HAVFY24_C_HEC_logo.png\" alt=\"Logo of BRAVIA Connect\" /></div>\n\n<div></div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__ContentHeader\">\n\n<h3 class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__Headline -Normal\">Complete surround sound with one system</h3>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__BodyCopy\">Get fully immersed. This 5.1ch system combines real and virtual surround technology to create an incredible audio experience, placing you at the centre of the action.</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div><img src=\"https://sony.scene7.com/is/image/sonyglobalsolutions/HAVFY25_EG1_Overview_Surround_1_M-1?$largeImageMobile$&fmt=png-alpha\" alt=\"Living room setup showcasing BRAVIA Theatre System 6 with immersive surround sound waves emanating from speakers around the room.\" /></div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__ContentHeader\">\n\n<h3 class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__Headline -Normal\">Every scene moves you with Dolby Atmos®</h3>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__BodyCopy\">Let Dolby Atmos® draw into a world of sound. Supporting the best in industry-standard formats, every moment feels larger than life.</div>\n\n<div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div><img src=\"https://sony.scene7.com/is/image/sonyglobalsolutions/HAVFY25_EG1_Overview_Surround_2_M-1?$largeImageMobile$&fmt=png-alpha\" alt=\"Living room with BRAVIA Theatre System 6 subwoofer emitting visual sound waves.\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__ContentHeader\">\n\n<h3 class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__Headline -Normal\">Surround yourself with pure power</h3>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__BodyCopy\">1000 W of pure power. Soundbar, subwoofer, and rear speakers work in harmony to deliver booming bass, soaring highs, and an energetic, immersive sound experience that’s nothing short of thrilling.</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div><img src=\"https://sony.scene7.com/is/image/sonyglobalsolutions/HAVFY25_EG1_Overview_Power_M-1?$largeImageMobile$&fmt=png-alpha\" alt=\"Living room with BRAVIA Theatre System 6 subwoofer emitting visual sound waves, illustrating powerful surround sound effect.\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__ContentHeader\">\n\n<h3 class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__Headline -Normal\">Crystal clear voice with every scene</h3>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__BodyCopy\">Crystal clear dialogue, even in the action. From quiet whispers to thundering action, voices come through crisp and clear, so you stay fully immersed without missing a line.</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div><img src=\"https://sony.scene7.com/is/image/sonyglobalsolutions/HAVFY25_EG1_Overview_Voice_M-1?$largeImageMobile$&fmt=png-alpha\" alt=\"Living room setup with BRAVIA Theatre System 6 soundbar projecting sound waves.\" /></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div class=\"LargeStaticImageHotSpot__ContentHeader\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><section class=\"component Highlights -SpacingTopSmall-20 -SpacingTopLarge-50 -SpacingBottomSmall-20 -SpacingBottomLarge-50\">\n\n<div class=\"component-content\" data-componenttype=\"highlights\" data-componentid=\"highlights-Highlights-en_MY-responsivegrid_layout_highlights\">\n\n<div class=\"Highlights__Inner CollapseContent -isExpanded\">\n\n<div class=\"CollapseContent__Body\">\n\n<div class=\"Highlights__KeySpec\">\n\n<div class=\"Highlights__SpecAndSize\">\n\n<div class=\"Highlights__Spec\">\n\n<div class=\"Highlights__SpecItems\">\n\n<div class=\"Highlights__SpecItem\">\n\n<p class=\"Highlights__SpecValue\"></p>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</section></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"FunctionLogos_awards_wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"FunctionalLogos_container\">\n\n<div class=\"FunctionalLogos_wrapper\">\n\n<div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
