    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Deep sound with Bass Reflex speaker</li>\n\n \t<li>Compact, space saving design</li>\n\n \t<li>Easy TV set up with HDMI ARC</li>\n\n \t<li>High sound quality from S-Force Front Surround</li>\n\n \t<li>Music play back with USB and Bluetooth</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>18 Months Manufacturer Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<div class=\"t2 editorial-headline js-editorial-headline\">Perfectly designed for entertainment</div>\n\n<p class=\"p2  editorial-body-copy js-editorial-body-copy\">Enjoy your favourite TV shows in enhanced sound quality delivered by this 2 channel sound bar with a Bass Reflex speaker. The HT-S100F’s slim profile design fits easily in your home and sits comfortably within any interiors.</p>\n\n<img src=\"https://www.sony-asia.com/image/ab35dab1800d838af34aeb315df77828?fmt=png-alpha&wid=720\" alt=\"HT-S100F streaming\" />\n\n\n\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://www.sony-asia.com/image/192dda1b4851864416dc51e25841556e?fmt=png-alpha&wid=250\" alt=\"Picture of 2ch Single Soundbar with Bluetooth® technology | HT-S100F\" width=\"718\" height=\"158\" />\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Built-in tweeter</strong>: Built-in tweeter recreates a full range of sounds, from the high note of your favorite song.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Two Channels</strong>: The two speaker setup delivers front surround sound from a compact unit.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Bass Reflex speaker</strong>: A speaker that delivers punchy bass without compromising detail and clarity, perfect for enjoying TV shows and music.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>High power with slim design</strong>: The Sony 2.0 Channel Soundbar with Bluetooth and Surround - HT-S100F packs a punch without sacrificing a compact profile, with an incredible output of 120W. Hear the booming sounds you love from your favorite shows and moves.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Wireless connectivity with your TV</strong>: Send audio to your sound bar wirelessly with a Bluetooth connection.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Hear sound come from all around</strong>: S-Force PRO Front Surround technology emulates cinema style sound fields for rich, high-fidelity audio that fills the room.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Stream with Bluetooth technology</strong>: Stream music wirelessly with Bluetooth technology.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Connect via USB</strong>: Plug in via USB to play back your favorite albums.</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Wall Mountable</strong>: Mount to the wall for seamless integration with your entertainment center.</li>\n\n</ul>",
