    "rating": 4.8,
    "image": "https://www.dwstore.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/download-2026-05-08T143615.659.webp",
    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Super Fast Charging to stay ready</li>\n\n \t<li>Compatible with various devices</li>\n\n \t<li>Enjoy the flexibility of the USB Type-C</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>6 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<div class=\"tabbed-content--tabs tabs-left\"><button class=\" active\">Description</button></div>\n\n<div class=\"tabbed-content--content rte text-left active\">\n\n<h4>Super Fast Charging to keep you in charge</h4>\n\nGive your devices the powerful charging support they deserve. The Samsung 25W Travel Adapter for Super Fast Charging (25W) provides Super Fast Charging at up to 25W for capable devices. Use the Wall Charger with an official Samsung Type C to Type C charging cable for optimum results.\n\n<h4>Get the ideal charge every time</h4>\n\nThis Wall Charger will not only quickly power the fastest charging devices, but it’ll also play well with other models too. So for standard PD 3.0 compatible devices you'll get a max 25W charge, while others charge at speeds they can handle. Get it in black or white to suit your style and device.\n\n\n\n<em>*Super Fast Charging requires a USB PD 3.0 compatible device that supports Direct Charging. Devices that do not support USB PD3.0 standard or Direct Charging will charge at a slower rate than SFC speed. **Actual charging speed may vary depending on other factors and device circumstances.</em>\n\n<h4>Specifications</h4>\n\n<strong>Features</strong>\n\nSuper Fast Charging max. 25W, PD 3.0 PPS max. 25W\n\n\n\n<strong>Interface</strong>\n\nUSB Type-C\n\n\n\n<strong>Packaging Contents</strong>\n\nSamsung 25W Travel Adapter\n\n<h4>Physical specification</h4>\n\n<strong>Dimension (WxHxD)</strong>\n\n50.25 x 68.75 x 27.21 mm\n\n\n\n<strong>Weight</strong>\n\n63 g\n\n<h4>Power</h4>\n\n<strong>Input Voltage</strong>\n\n100-240 V\n\n\n\n<strong>Output Voltage (Max, Normal Charge)</strong>\n\n5 V\n\n\n\n<strong>Output Voltage (Max, Fast Charge)</strong>\n\nPDO : 9V / PPS : 3.3-5.9V or 3.3-11.0V\n\n\n\n<strong>Output Current (Max, Normal Charge)</strong>\n\n3 A\n\n\n\n<strong>Output Current (Max, Fast Charge)</strong>\n\nPDO : 2.77A(9V) / PPS : 3.0A(3.3-5.9V) or 2.25A(3.3-11.0V)\n\n<div class=\"feature-benefit-full-bleed__content-wrap\">\n\n<div class=\"feature-benefit-full-bleed__content-inner \">\n\n<div class=\"feature-benefit-full-bleed__content-area\">\n\n<h2 class=\"feature-benefit-full-bleed__title\" data-font-size-pc=\"48\" data-font-size-mo=\"30\">ave on the stand-by</h2>\n\n<p class=\"feature-benefit-full-bleed__text\" data-font-size-pc=\"18\" data-font-size-mo=\"12\">Not always full-throttle. The Power Adapter minimizes your standby power from 20mW to 5mW, maximizing your energy savings up to 75%. It's also made from a blend of materials that are mindful of the planet, which keeps us attentive in more ways.</p>\n\n\n\n<span class=\"feature-benefit-full-bleed__disclaimer\">*Plastic of Power Adapter was created using recycled materials which has been validated by the UL.\n\n**The plastic part of EP-T2510 contains a minimum of 20% recycled content.</span></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<figure class=\"feature-benefit-full-bleed__figure\">\n\n<div class=\"image image--dyn-height image--main-loaded\"><img class=\"image__preview responsive-img image--loaded image--hide\" src=\"https://images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/sa_en/feature/164869598/sa_en-feature-save-on-the-stand-by-538758010?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$\" alt=\"A white Power Adapter shows the side with the USB-C port. Encircling the adapter is a ring that shows a thunderbolt icon as well as text that reads '5 mw'. At the bottom right, a UL Environmental Claim Validation Mark is shown that reads 'VALIDATED. The plastic part of EP-T2510 contains a minimum of 20% recycled content. UL.COM/ECV'.\" data-desktop-alt=\"A white Power Adapter shows the side with the USB-C port. Encircling the adapter is a ring that shows a thunderbolt icon as well as text that reads '5 mw'. At the bottom right, a UL Environmental Claim Validation Mark is shown that reads 'VALIDATED. The plastic part of EP-T2510 contains a minimum of 20% recycled content. UL.COM/ECV'.\" data-comp-name=\"image\" data-desktop-src=\"//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/sa_en/feature/164869598/sa_en-feature-save-on-the-stand-by-538758010?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$\" data-mobile-alt=\"A white Power Adapter shows the side with the USB-C port. Encircling the adapter is a ring that shows a thunderbolt icon as well as text that reads '5 mw'. At the bottom right, a UL Environmental Claim Validation Mark is shown that reads 'VALIDATED. The plastic part of EP-T2510 contains a minimum of 20% recycled content. UL.COM/ECV'.\" data-mobile-src=\"//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/sa_en/feature/164869598/sa_en-feature-save-on-the-stand-by-538758011?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$\" aria-hidden=\"true\" /><img class=\"image__main responsive-img image--loaded\" src=\"https://images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/sa_en/feature/164869598/sa_en-feature-save-on-the-stand-by-538758010?$FB_TYPE_K_JPG$\" alt=\"A white Power Adapter shows the side with the USB-C port. Encircling the adapter is a ring that shows a thunderbolt icon as well as text that reads '5 mw'. At the bottom right, a UL Environmental Claim Validation Mark is shown that reads 'VALIDATED. The plastic part of EP-T2510 contains a minimum of 20% recycled content. UL.COM/ECV'.\" data-desktop-alt=\"A white Power Adapter shows the side with the USB-C port. Encircling the adapter is a ring that shows a thunderbolt icon as well as text that reads '5 mw'. At the bottom right, a UL Environmental Claim Validation Mark is shown that reads 'VALIDATED. The plastic part of EP-T2510 contains a minimum of 20% recycled content. UL.COM/ECV'.\" data-comp-name=\"image\" data-desktop-src=\"//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/sa_en/feature/164869598/sa_en-feature-save-on-the-stand-by-538758010?$FB_TYPE_K_JPG$\" data-mobile-alt=\"A white Power Adapter shows the side with the USB-C port. Encircling the adapter is a ring that shows a thunderbolt icon as well as text that reads '5 mw'. At the bottom right, a UL Environmental Claim Validation Mark is shown that reads 'VALIDATED. The plastic part of EP-T2510 contains a minimum of 20% recycled content. UL.COM/ECV'.\" data-mobile-src=\"//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/sa_en/feature/164869598/sa_en-feature-save-on-the-stand-by-538758011?$FB_TYPE_I_JPG$\" /></div></figure>\n\n</div>",
