    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"176df5\" data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"76\">Dual-Channel Wireless Lavalier Microphone System</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"c7ncfb\" data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"145\">Advanced Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) for Clear Voice Recording</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1onpkw\" data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"203\">Reduces Background Noise for Professional Audio Quality</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1pzktdp\" data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"247\">Plug & Play – No Apps or Drivers Required</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"sjlre6\" data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"285\">Stable 2.4GHz Wireless Transmission</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"4qpnru\" data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"342\">Dual Microphones for Simultaneous Two-Person Recording</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1r8vp0i\" data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"378\">Omnidirectional 360° Audio Pickup</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"z7n7gh\" data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"413\">Low-Latency Wireless Performance</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"wb5af4\" data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"463\">Lightweight Clip-On Design for Comfortable Wear</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"aylmug\" data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"497\">Portable Charging Case Included</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"n06v1f\" data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"538\">LED Battery Indicator on Charging Case</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"19lci0g\" data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"596\">Compatible with Smartphones and Other Supported Devices</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"17el77f\" data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"673\">Ideal for YouTube, TikTok, Vlogging, Interviews, Podcasts & Live Streaming</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1cfwor8\" data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"732\">Perfect for Online Meetings, Teaching & Content Creation</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1ikml3s\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"768\">Compact, Portable & Easy to Carry</li>\n\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1nka2r0\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"860\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Reliable Performance for Indoor & Outdoor Recording</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>3 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<h3>Description:</h3>\n\n<div>Capture pristine, broadcast-quality audio with the Plokama VM-80 Pro Wireless Lavalier Microphone System. Engineered for multi-device flexibility, this professional microphone kit comes packed with multi-interface cables to offer seamless plug-and-play compatibility with smartphones (iPhone and Type-C), DSLR cameras, and camcorders. Featuring advanced Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) technology and a 360-degree omnidirectional sound pickup design, it guarantees crystal-clear voice capture from every angle while drowning out distracting ambient noise. The premium storage case doubles as a smart charging hub, equipped with an integrated LED digital screen to track your real-time power levels, making it the ultimate tool for interviewers, content creators, and vloggers.</div>\n\n<div></div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div><b>Key Features:</b></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"message-list_1783332657.544529\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-sender primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-message_text primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-alt_text primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-date_time primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-reaction_count primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-reply_count primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-link_count primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-attachment_count primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-has_draft_reply primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-pinned_state primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-edited_state primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-later_state primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-broadcast_state primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-broadcast_thread_root_message primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783332657.544529-translated_state\">\n\n<div aria-roledescription=\"message\">\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div id=\"message-list\">\n\n<div id=\"message-list\">\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div id=\"message-list\">\n\n<div id=\"message-list\">\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div id=\"message-list_1783506366.647919\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-sender primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-message_text primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-alt_text primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-date_time primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-reaction_count primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-reply_count primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-link_count primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-attachment_count primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-has_draft_reply primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-pinned_state primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-edited_state primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-later_state primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-broadcast_state primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-broadcast_thread_root_message primary-D0ALP2VGFN1-1783506366.647919-translated_state\">\n\n<div>\n\n<div aria-roledescription=\"message\">\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<div>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><b>Advanced ANC Technology:</b> Built-in Active Noise Cancellation aggressively filters out background drone and environmental noise for pristine broadcast quality.</li>\n\n \t<li><b>360° Omnidirectional Sound Pickup:</b> Captures clear, immersive audio evenly from all directions, ensuring you never miss a word during intense shoots.</li>\n\n \t<li><b>Universal Multi-Device Compatibility:</b> Bundled with premium cables for 3.5mm AUX, Lightning, and Type-C connectivity, making it fully ready for smartphones, DSLR cameras, and laptops.</li>\n\n \t<li><b>Smart Digital Charging Case:</b> Features a sleek integrated LED power indicator display panel to manage individual component battery levels instantly.</li>\n\n \t<li><b>Dual-Channel Recording:</b> Ideal for dual-person interviews, podcasts, and collaborative content creation with an ultra-stable wireless range.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
