    "description": "<h2>Sony IER-EX15C USB-C Earphone</h2>\n\n<h4><strong>Just plug and play</strong></h4>\n\nThese compact USB-C®<sup>12</sup> earphones fit easily in your ears—and your day. No batteries, no setup. Just connect to your device and get straight to your music, meeting, or call. Lightweight, portable, and built for quick use anywhere.\n\n<h4><strong>High quality sound. Always.</strong></h4>\n\nDespite their size, the IER-EX15C reproduces powerful bass and crystal clear vocals, bringing out the best in all genres of music.\n\n<h4>Volume and mute at your fingertips</h4>\n\nThe in-line remote control puts the essentials in reach. Adjust volume, mute the mic, or play/pause<sup>23</sup>, while your device can stay in your bag or pocket. Quick, simple, and designed to keep you connected through your day.\n\n<h4>Your colour. Your look.</h4>\n\nWith four colours to choose from—black, white, blue, and pink<sup>4</sup> — it’s easy to match your earphones to your style. Subtle, bright, or neutral, the choice is yours.\n\n<h4>Environment & Accessibility</h4>\n\nNo plastic is used in the packaging of IER-EX15C<sup>5</sup>. It’s a small step in reducing environmental impact, and part of our broader sustainability goals.",
