    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Mikorean</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Model:</strong> MGP-L016</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Battery Capacity:</strong> 10000mAh</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Fast Charging:</strong> PD 20W / SCP 22.5W</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Built-in Cables:</strong> Type-C & Lightning</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>6 Months Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "The Mikorean MGP-L016 power bank is a compact and high-performance portable charger designed for fast, safe and convenient charging. It features built-in Type-C and Lightning cables, making it ideal for daily use and travel.\n\n<b>Key Features</b>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>10000mAh high-capacity battery</li>\n\n \t<li>Built-in <strong>2 charging cables</strong> (Type-C & Lightning)</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>PD 20W fast charging support</strong></li>\n\n \t<li><strong>SCP 22.5W fast charging support</strong></li>\n\n \t<li>Smart power adaptation technology</li>\n\n \t<li>Compact and portable design</li>\n\n \t<li>Multiple safety protection system</li>\n\n</ul>\n\nFast Charging TechnologySupports both <strong>PD (Power Delivery) 20W</strong> and <strong>SCP 22.5W</strong>, allowing compatible devices to charge faster and more efficiently than standard power banks.\n\n<b>Built-in Dual Cables</b>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Type-C cable – for modern Android phones, tablets and gadgets</li>\n\n \t<li>Lightning cable – for iPhone and compatible Apple devices</li>\n\n</ul>\n\nNo need to carry extra cables.\n\n<b>Safety ProtectionBuilt-in protection system helps prevent:</b>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Over-charging</li>\n\n \t<li>Over-current</li>\n\n \t<li>Over-voltage</li>\n\n \t<li>Over-heating</li>\n\n</ul>\n\nEnsuring safe and stable charging for your devices.\n\n<b>Product Specifications</b>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Brand:</strong> Mikorean</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Model:</strong> MGP-L016</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Battery Capacity:</strong> 10000mAh</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Fast Charging:</strong> PD 20W / SCP 22.5W</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Built-in Cables:</strong> Type-C & Lightning</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<b>Input</b>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Type-C Input:</strong>\n\n5V⎓2A / 5V⎓3A / 9V⎓2.22A / 12V⎓1.5A</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<b>Output</b>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><strong>Type-C Cable Output:</strong>\n\n5V⎓2A / 5V⎓3A / 9V⎓2.2A / 12V⎓1.65A</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>Lightning Cable Output:</strong>\n\n5V⎓2.4A</li>\n\n \t<li><strong>USB-C Output:</strong>\n\n5V⎓2A / 5V⎓3A / 9V⎓2.2A / 12V⎓1.5A / 10V⎓2.25A</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<b>Compatible With</b>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Android smartphones</li>\n\n \t<li>iPhones (via built-in Lightning cable)</li>\n\n \t<li>Tablets, earbuds, and other USB devices</li>\n\n</ul>",
