    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Brand: Plokama</li>\n\n \t<li>Model: DT-100</li>\n\n \t<li>Product Material: ABS+metal</li>\n\n \t<li>Height Adjustment: 22cm – 41cm</li>\n\n \t<li>Rotation 360° horizontal & 270° vertical tilt</li>\n\n \t<li>Compatibility: Mobile phones and tablets up to 12.9 inches</li>\n\n \t<li>Mount Type: Clamp-on desktop base</li>\n\n \t<li>Application: Photography, recording, unboxing, makeup, and online teaching</li>\n\n</ul>",
    "description": "<h2>PLOKAMA DT100 Flexible Aluminium Desktop Stand – 360° Rotatable Phone & Tablet Holder</h2>\n\nThe <strong>Plokama DT-100 Desktop Phone Holder</strong> Flexible Aluminium Desktop Stand is designed for creators who need stability, flexibility, and professional angles for their photography and video projects. With a 360° rotatable holder and adjustable arm, it allows perfect positioning for overhead shots, tutorials, and live streams. Built from high-quality aluminium, it ensures long-lasting durability and smooth operation.\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Adjustable Height: Easily changes from 22cm to 41cm for sitting or standing use.</li>\n\n \t<li>360° Rotation & 180° Tilt: Ball joint and articulated arm offer full flexibility for angles.</li>\n\n \t<li>Stable Base: Heavy, thickened metal base prevents shaking.</li>\n\n \t<li>Device Protection: Soft silicone pads protect your phone/tablet from slipping and scratching.</li>\n\n \t<li>Multi-Camera/Device Use: Can hold multiple devices or be set up for downward (flat lay) shots.</li>\n\n \t<li>Compatibility: Fits most smartphones and tablets.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Brand: Plokama</li>\n\n \t<li>Model: DT-100</li>\n\n \t<li>Product Material: ABS+metal</li>\n\n \t<li>Height Adjustment: 22cm – 41cm</li>\n\n \t<li>Rotation 360° horizontal & 270° vertical tilt</li>\n\n \t<li>Compatibility: Mobile phones and tablets up to 12.9 inches</li>\n\n \t<li>Mount Type: Clamp-on desktop base</li>\n\n \t<li>Application: Photography, recording, unboxing, makeup, and online teaching</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<strong>Package Includes:</strong>\n\n1 x PLOKAMA DT80 / DT100 Flexible Aluminium Desktop Stand\n\n1 x Phone/Tablet Holder\n\n1 x User Manual",
