    "description": "<h1>PLOKAMA K6 LED Selfie Stick</h1>\n\n<p data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3410\">The PLOKAMA K6 LED Bluetooth Selfie Stick Tripod is the perfect accessory for capturing high-quality selfies, videos, and group photos anytime, anywhere. Designed with a built-in LED fill light, it helps you take brighter and clearer shots even in low-light environments. The wireless Bluetooth remote allows easy hands-free photography, while the integrated tripod provides stable support for video recording, live streaming, and video calls.</p>\n\n<p data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3773\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Its foldable and lightweight design makes it easy to carry during travel, outdoor activities, or daily use. The extendable rod offers wider shooting angles, making it ideal for selfies, vlogging, and content creation. Compatible with most Android and iPhone smartphones, the PLOKAMA K6 combines portability, convenience, and functionality in one stylish device.</p>\n\n \n\n\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-102430 size-full\" src=\"https://otc.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/PLOKAMA-K6-LED-Selfie-Stick-by-OTC.lk-in-Sri-Lanka-4.jpg\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" srcset=\"https://otc.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/PLOKAMA-K6-LED-Selfie-Stick-by-OTC.lk-in-Sri-Lanka-4.jpg 600w, https://otc.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/PLOKAMA-K6-LED-Selfie-Stick-by-OTC.lk-in-Sri-Lanka-4-300x300.jpg 300w, https://otc.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/PLOKAMA-K6-LED-Selfie-Stick-by-OTC.lk-in-Sri-Lanka-4-150x150.jpg 150w, https://otc.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/PLOKAMA-K6-LED-Selfie-Stick-by-OTC.lk-in-Sri-Lanka-4-100x100.jpg 100w\" alt=\"PLOKAMA K6 LED selfie stick tripod with Bluetooth remote.\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" />",
