    "description": "<h2>Anker 45W Nano Charger USB C Fast Charger A2692K11 | Compact PD Charger for Phones, Tablets & Laptops</h2>\n\nThe <strong>Anker Nano Charger 45W USB C Fast Charger</strong> (A2692K11) delivers strong, reliable charging performance in a lightweight and travel-ready design. Built with advanced PD technology, this fast charger powers smartphones, tablets and many USB-C laptops with steady speed. It is a dependable choice for daily charging at home, work or on the go in Sri Lanka.\n\n<h3>Key Features of Anker Nano Charger 45W USB-C Fast Charger</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Compact 45W USB-C charger for fast and efficient device charging.</li>\n\n \t<li>Supports Power Delivery for rapid charging of compatible devices.</li>\n\n \t<li>Ultra-portable design fits easily in pockets or small bags.</li>\n\n \t<li>Advanced safety features protect against overheating and overcurrent.</li>\n\n \t<li>Wide compatibility with USB-C devices, including smartphones and tablets.</li>\n\n \t<li>Durable construction ensures long-lasting, reliable performance.</li>\n\n \t<li>Energy-efficient design reduces power consumption during idle periods.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li>Model: A2692K11</li>\n\n \t<li>Power Output: 45W</li>\n\n \t<li>Technology: USB-C Power Delivery</li>\n\n \t<li>Input: AC 100-240V ~ 1.2A 50-60Hz</li>\n\n \t<li>Output (USB-C): 5V⎓3A / 9V⎓3A / 12V⎓3A / 15V⎓3A / 20V⎓2.25A (max 45W)</li>\n\n \t<li>Output (PPS): 5.0V-11.0V⎓5.0A / 4.5V-21.0V⎓2.25A / 5.0V-16.0V⎓3.0A (max 45W)</li>\n\n \t<li>Total output: 45W</li>\n\n \t<li>Compatibility: Smartphones, tablets, USB-C laptops (varies by device power requirements)</li>\n\n \t<li>Protection: Temperature control, surge protection, safe current regulation</li>\n\n \t<li>Colour: Black</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<strong>Package Includes</strong>\n\n1 × Anker Nano Charger 45W",
