    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>25W Rapid Charging</li>\n\n \t<li>33% Smaller, Compact and Portable</li>\n\n \t<li>Universal Compatibility</li>\n\n \t<li>Anker’s MultiProtect System for Superior Safety</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>1 Year Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<strong>Anker 25W Compact Charger with Type-C to Type-C Cable</strong>\n\n\n\nAnker Charger (25W, Compact) with USB-C Cable – Fast Charging in a Compact Package!\n\nCharge your devices faster and more efficiently with the Anker Charger (25W, Compact). Optimized for Samsung smartphones, this 25W charger rapidly powers up your devices, getting your Samsung S24+ to 50% in under 30 minutes! Featuring a sleek, compact design, it’s about 33% smaller than regular chargers, making it the perfect travel companion. With universal compatibility, you can use it to charge Android smartphones, Apple devices, and more!\n\n\n\nRapid Charging – 25W output for fast charging of your Samsung devices\n\nCompact and Portable – 33% smaller than standard chargers, with a foldable plug for easy storage\n\nUniversal Compatibility – Charge your Android, Apple, and other devices with ease\n\nSuperior Safety – Features Anker’s MultiProtect system for overvoltage protection, current regulation, and more\n\nOne Charger, Many Devices – Eliminate clutter with one charger for all your devices\n\nPerfect for Travel – Compact, lightweight, and easy to carry\n\n\n\n<strong>Specifications:</strong>\n\nTotal Wattage: 25W\n\nInput: 100-240V~, 0.8A, 50-60Hz\n\nOutput: 5V⎓3A / 9V⎓2.77A\n\nPPS: 5V-11V⎓2.75A Max (25W Max)\n\nDimensions: 1.22 x 1.22 x 1.42 in / 31 x 31 x 36 mm\n\nWeight: 1.76 oz / 50 g\n\n\n\n<strong>What’s in the Box</strong>\n\n• 1 x Anker Charger (25W, Compact)\n\n• 1 x 5ft USB-C to USB-C Cable\n\n• 1 x Welcome Guide",
