    "image": "/products/images/c1676a767f.png",
    "shortDesc": "<ul>\n\n \t<li>Lightweight Wireless On-Ear Headphones</li>\n\n \t<li>30mm Dynamic Drivers for Quality Sound</li>\n\n \t<li>Up to 55 Hours of Music Playback</li>\n\n \t<li>Up to 35 Hours of Talk Time</li>\n\n \t<li>Bluetooth 6.0 Wireless Connectivity</li>\n\n \t<li>AI Noise Reduction for Clear Voice Calls</li>\n\n \t<li>DSEE Digital Sound Enhancement Technology</li>\n\n \t<li>Multipoint Connection for Two Devices</li>\n\n \t<li>SBC, AAC & LC3 Audio Codec Support</li>\n\n \t<li>Comfortable 150g Lightweight Design</li>\n\n \t<li>USB Charging with Approximately 3-Hour Full Charge</li>\n\n \t<li>Built-in Volume & Playback Controls</li>\n\n \t<li>Closed-Back On-Ear Design</li>\n\n \t<li>Available in Six Stylish Colours</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h4>1 Year Manufacturer Warranty</h4>",
    "description": "<h2>Sony WH-CH530 Wireless Headphones</h2>\n\n<h4>High-Quality Sound with 30mm Drivers</h4>\n\nThe Sony WH-CH530 wireless headphones feature 30mm dynamic drivers designed to deliver clear and enjoyable sound for music, podcasts, movies, and everyday entertainment. Their balanced audio performance makes them suitable for daily listening.\n\n<h4>Up to 55 Hours of Battery Life</h4>\n\nEnjoy up to 55 hours of music playback on a single charge, making the Sony WH-CH530 ideal for commuting, travelling, working, studying, and extended listening sessions without frequent recharging.\n\n<h4>AI Noise Reduction for Clear Calls</h4>\n\nBuilt-in AI noise reduction technology helps reduce unwanted background noise during voice calls, allowing clearer communication for phone conversations, online meetings, and video calls.\n\n<h4>Bluetooth 6.0 Wireless Connectivity</h4>\n\nWith Bluetooth 6.0 wireless technology, the Sony WH-CH530 provides convenient connectivity with compatible smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other Bluetooth-enabled devices.\n\n<h4>Multipoint Connection</h4>\n\nMultipoint connectivity allows the headphones to connect to two compatible devices simultaneously. Easily switch between listening to music on your laptop and answering calls on your smartphone.\n\n<h4>DSEE Digital Sound Enhancement</h4>\n\nSony’s Digital Sound Enhancement Engine (DSEE) helps improve compressed digital audio by restoring some of the sound detail lost during compression, providing an enhanced listening experience.\n\n<h4>Lightweight & Comfortable Design</h4>\n\nWeighing approximately 150g, the Sony WH-CH530 features a lightweight, closed-back on-ear design that is comfortable for everyday listening, whether at home, in the office, or while travelling.\n\n<h4>Advanced Audio Codec Support</h4>\n\nWith SBC, AAC, and LC3 audio codec support, the headphones offer flexible wireless audio compatibility with supported Bluetooth devices.\n\n<h4>Convenient USB Charging</h4>\n\nThe Sony WH-CH530 supports USB charging, with a full charge taking approximately three hours. Its long battery life provides reliable performance throughout everyday activities.\n\n<h4>Up to 35 Hours of Talk Time</h4>\n\nWith up to 35 hours of talk time, the headphones are suitable for extended phone conversations, online meetings, remote working, and communication throughout the day.\n\n<h4>Easy-to-Use Controls</h4>\n\nBuilt-in controls allow convenient volume adjustment and playback management, making it easy to control your audio without constantly accessing your connected device.\n\n<h4>Stylish Colour Options</h4>\n\nThe Sony WH-CH530 is available in six attractive colours: Black, White, Pink, Coral, Mint, and Cobalt, allowing you to choose a style that matches your preference.\n\n<h4>Ideal for Everyday Entertainment</h4>\n\nCombining wireless connectivity, lightweight comfort, long battery life, and clear calling features, the Sony WH-CH530 is a practical choice for music, online classes, work, travel, and daily entertainment.",
